<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu wa Yohana</para>
  <para style="ip">Habali Maha kukovekelana na Yohana ni imonga paghati gha vihitabu vinjechi Kulilaghano Lyonu vyeni kulongelela ngalilu gha Yesu Kilisito. Kila kimonga kya kyeni kingukemwa Injili yeni kumaanisa Habali Maha. Vihitabu havi viyandikilwi badili gha kihu kya Yesu. Na vyeni viyandikilwi na Matayu na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohana. Kihitabu haki kya Habali Maha pangi kiyandikilwi na Mndumindumi Yohana paghati gha machuva gha itisini badili gha kuhova kwa Kilisito. Pamonga na yiwa kihitabu haki kingulonga ng'ogha Yohana ndiwa myandika, ila mtindu wa kuyandika ungulandana nesu na mahamba gha 1 Yohana, na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana. Wayandika waghangi wa dahile walongile Yohana akilikala kummbwani wa Efesu kwa lipindi hali, hinu kuwela na muwesekanu wa kihitabu kiwelili kiyandikwa haku Efesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana angulongelela lipala lukani lwa kihitabu haki yiwa ni kuwatanga wandu kukwinila Yesu ndiwa Kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga mkomu Sula gha 20:31. Kwa kukwinila tunguwesa kuwela na ukomu kulihina lyaki. Kihitabu kiyandikilwi kwa lukani kisomwi na Wayahudi na wala Wayahudi ng'ogha. Habali Maha gha Yohana kwa ndambu itenu ingulandana ng'ogha na Habali Maha zighangi itatu. Kwaikiva awikili mkasu kumakangasu agholile Yesu na kuyandika matangala yeni kulongelela milandanu ghaki. Mighalu mighangi mikulunga gha Yesu handa ubatisu wa Yesu na mayesu kuluvagha hilahila yayandikwa ng'ogha ku Habali Maha hai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana angutumbula kuyandika Habali Maha ku Sula gha 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi kuulongolo anguyandika amonga gha makakangasu Yesu aigholile Sula gha 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi angulongelela mighalu mitangala ihumilile kungalilu yeni kuyambusa kuhova kwa Yesu mbaka kuhinduka kwaki Sula gha 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana anguyomola kuyandika Habali Maha hai ku Sula gha 21 akilongelela amonga gha Habali kulipindi Yesu kawahumila wandu badili gha kuhinduka na kulongela lukani lwaki lwa kuyandika kihitabu haki.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Lilando lyeni kuyegha ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Pambila gha mlima wogha kulumbwa Lilando awelili, hayu Lilando awelili pamonga na Sapanga na mweni Lilando awelili Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuhuma mtumbulo hayu Lilando awelili pamonga na Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Sapanga alumbili kila kindu kwa kupitila Lilando. Kwahela chochose kyeni kulumbwa bila Lilando. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Lilando ndiwa kawesesa kila kindu kulama, kwaikiva mweni ndiwa kayegha mhana kwa wandu wogha. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Mhana hau ungulangasa mulwiha, na lwiha liwesili ng'ogha kuusinda.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Sapanga amulaghilile mundu mmonga mweni kukemwa Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yohana ahikile kuwalongela wandu habali gha mhana hau, ili wandu wogha wapati kuhyoghanila na kukwinila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana awelili ng'ogha hau mhana, ila ahikili kulongelela hau mhana. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Hau ndiwa mhana wa chakaka, unguhika kumlimawogha, na kuwalangasila wandu wogha.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Hinu, hayu Lilando awelili mumlimawogha, pamonga na yiwa kwa kupitila mweni Sapanga alumbile mlima wogha, ila mlima wogha uwesile ng'ogha kummanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ahikili kumlima ghaki, ila wandu ghaki wampokelile ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ila wala wogha wampokelili na kumkwinila, awagholile waweli wana wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Hagha wawela ng'ogha wana wa Sapanga vila wandu wanguweleka. Waweleka ng'ogha kwaikiva wandu wangupala hela kuwela na wana. Hilahila wanguweleka ng'ogha kwaikiva mundu angupala kuwela na mwana, ila waweleka na Sapanga mweni.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Hayu Lilando akawela mundu, na akalikala paghati gha twenga, na twenga tukaulola ukulu ghaki, ukulu wa mwana wa weka wa Tati, kangi akiwela kamema umaha na uchakaka.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana awalongelelili wandu mighalu gha mundu hayu, akalongela kwa lilowi, Hayu ndiwa yula niwalongelili yiwa, “Hayu mweni kuhika badili gha nenga ni mkulu kupiti nenga, kwaikiva awelili haku pambila gha nenga kuweleka.”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwaikiva ni mmaha nesu, twenga wogha tupokela highili zitangala nesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwaikiva dahile Sapanga ayeghili laghililo kwa kupitila Musa, ila hinaa umaha na chakaka tupokela kwa Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kwahela mundu yoyose amwonile Sapanga, ila Mwana weka yaki, mweni kapamonga na Tati hinu kwa nagha katulangiha vila Sapanga kawela na mweni ni Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Yohana Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Lichuwa limonga vilongosi wa Wayahudi wawayeghili watambika na walawi kuhuma ku Yelusalemu wamkonyi Yohana yiwa, “Wenga ni ghani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana akawayanga kinaga ubaga, “Nenga ng'ogha Kilisito mkombola ahaghulilwi na Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Hinu wakamkonya kangi, “Wenga ni ghani? Ghuli, wenga ni Elia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana akayanga, “Ng'ogha, ng'ogha nenga.” Wakamkonya kangi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ghuli wenga ni yula mlota wa Sapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana akawayanga, “Ng'ogha, ng'ogha nenga,”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ndiwa wakamlongela, “Hinu utulongeli yiwa wenga kwa ghani ili tupati lilando lya kuwayeghela wala watulaghilili. Wenga mweni ungulonga niki?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana akawayanga, “Nenga ndiwa yula mwenikuwela mlota Isaya alongelile habali zyaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Nenga ni lilowi lya mundu mweni kutangasa kuhuma mluvagha,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Mgholi njila gha Bambu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ndiwa wala wandu wawelili walaghililwi na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />wakamkonya Yohana, “Handa wenga ng'ogha Kilisito, ng'ogha Elia, ng'ogha yula mlota wa Sapanga, kwa kyani hinu ungubatisa?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana akawayanga, “Nenga ningubatisa kwa masi, ila paghati gha mwenga kawela yula mwenga mungummanya ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Hayu anguhika kuulongolo gha nenga, nenga nipaliwa ng'ogha hata kumuwoposola ngoi zya makubasi ghaki.” <figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mundu kavala makubasi</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mighalu hai ihumilili haku ku Betania, kumwambu gha lweni Yoludani mahala Yohana awelili angubatisa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanakondolu wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Kilau ghaki Yohana amwonili Yesu akimhikila, akalonga, “Hayu ndiwa mwanakondolu wa Sapanga anguhumisa sambi sya wandu wogha!” <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Hayu ndiwa niwalongelili mighalu ghaki paniwalongelile, “Kuulongolo gha nenga anguhika mundu mmonga kawela mkulu nesu kupiti nenga, kwaikiva awelili pambila gha nenga kuweleka.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />“Nenga mweni baha nimmanyili ng'ogha, ila nihika kubatisa kwa masi ili apati kuhighiliswa kwa wandu wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Hinu Yohana akawalangiha akilonga, “Nenga niwelili na nikamlola Mpumulo kuhuma kundumba akihuluka handa ngunda vila anguhuluka na akatama kunani ghaki.” <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nenga nimmanyili ng'ogha, ila yula anilaghilili kubatisa kwa masi, hayu kanilongela kala, “Mundu yula utemlola akihulukilwa na Mpumulo kuhuma kundumba na kulikala kunani ghaki, hayu ndiwa atewabatisa wandu kwa Mpumulo ghangu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ndiwa Yohana akalongela, “Nenga mweni baha nilola kwa mihu ghangu mghalu hau na ningulongela yiwa hayu ndiwa Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavulwa wa mtumbulo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Kilau ghaki, Yohana awelili kagholoka kangi mahala haku pamonga na wavulwa ghaki waivili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Paamlolili Yesu angutyanga, akalonga, “Mumloli, hayu ndiwa Mwanakondolu wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wala wavulwa waivili pawamhyoghanila Yohana akilonga milando hai wakamkovikela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu akaghalambuka akawalola wakimkovikela, akawakonya munguhaka kyani?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wakamyanga, “Rabi,” ingumanyisa ni mvula, “Ungulikala kugha?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu akawalongela, “Muhiki na mwenga mtelola.” Wala wavulwa wakamkovekela, wakalola mahala awelili angulikala, wakalikala na mweni lichuwa lila. Kwaikiva iwelili kala isaa ikumi lumihi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Mvulwa mmonga paghati gha wavulwa waivili wenikuwela wayoghanilili milando gha Yohana, na kumkovekela Yesu lihina lyaki awelili akikemwa Andeleya mlongo ghaki Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Bahala Andeleya akahuka na kuyenda kumuhakula Simoni mlongu ghaki na kumlongela, “Tumlola Masia” Ingumanisa, “Kilisito.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Hinu mweni akamyegha kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu akamlola na kulonga, “Wenga ni Simoni mwana wa Yohana. Utekemwa Kefa” Kigiliki ni Petelo ingumaanisa mghomba.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwakema Filipo na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Kilau ghaki Yesu alamulili kuyenda ku Galilaya. Haku akakongine na Filipo, akamlongela, “Ungovikeli.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo awelili mwenikaya wa Betisaida mmbwani wawelili wakikala akina Andelea na Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo amwonili Natanaeli, akamlongela, “Tumlola Mundu yula Musa ayandikile habali zyaki ku kihitabu kya laghililo, na walota wayandikile habali zyaki, lihina lyaki ni Yesu, Mwana wa Yusufu, mundu wa mmbwani wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli akamkonya Filipo, “Ghuli lilando lya maha linguwesa kuhuma ku Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo akamlongela “Uhiki uloli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu paamwonili Natanaeli anguhika kwa mweni, akatumbula kulongelela habali zya Natanieli akilonga, “Mloli, hayu ni muizilaeli wa chakaka kahela uhakata mghati ghaki.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli akamkonya, “Uwesaghuli kunimanya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu akamuyanga, “Pauwelili pahi gha libiki lya tini, hata pambila gha Filipo kakukema, nikulolili.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Pala Natanaeli akamlongela, “Mvula wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga. Wenga ndiwa Nkosi wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamyanga, “Ghuli, ungukwinila kwaikiva nikulongelili yiwa nikuwonile pauwela pahi gha libiki lya tini? Hinu utelola mighalu mikulunga ipiti hagha.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Ninguwalongela chakaka, mtelola kundumba kukiwoposoka na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wakikwela na kuhuluka kunani gha Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Mhambu wa uposo kummbwani wa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Lichuwa lya itatu kuwelili na mhambu wa uposo kummbwani wa kana, kumlima wa Galilaya. Kumhambu hau nyongo ghaki Yesu na mweni awelili pala. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki wawelili wamluwa Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wayendi kumhambu wa uposo hula. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai paipelili, nyongo ghaki Yesu akamlongela, “Wandu wawela ng'ogha na divai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamyanga, “Nyongo, ukotoho kunilongela lila lya kughola. Lisaa lyangu lya kughola lihengu lyambila.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Pala nyongo ghaki akawalongela watumikila, “Chochosi atewalongela, mgholi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Pala pawelili na ndeleku isita gha masi yeni kugholwa kwa maganga. Masi ghala yawelili pala kwa lukani lwa kujighulula handa wayovilile Wayahudi, kila lindeleku liwesa kuyingila madebi maivili au maitatu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mumemesi ndeleku hasi masi.” Weni wakamemesa neku neku. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Hinaa mteki, mumyegheli mkulu wa mhambu,” ndiwa wakateka masi na kumyeghela mkulu wa mhambu hula. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Yula mkulu wa mhambu hula akanywegha ghala masi yenikuwela yaghalambuka kuwela divai. Mweni kamanya ng'ogha kugha ihumili, ila wala watumikila watekili masi wamanyili. Mkulu wa muhambu akamkema bambu wa muhambu wa uposo mmbali, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akamlongela, “Wandu wanguyegha mtumbulo divai maha hata paiwakwila, na kuulongolo ikikovekela hila divai yuyughu. Ila wenga unguyegha divai gha maha mbaka hinaa.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu agholili kilangihi haki kya utumbulo haku kana, Galilaya, akalangiha ukulu ghaki na weni wavulwa ghaki wakamkwinila.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Badili gha hagha, Yesu pamonga na nyongo ghaki, walongu ghaki na wavulwa ghaki, wakahuluka mbaka Kapelinaumu wakalikala haku machuwa mayaghani.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ku Lighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayu 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliku 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Paihika pabehi na lichuwa lya mhambu wa Pasaka gha Wayahudi, hinu Yesu akakwela kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Haku kweni lyugha kulighuta lya Sapanga akawalola wandu wakiwusa ng'ombi, kondolu na ngunda, na amonga walikalili mesa wakibadilisana mapesa. <figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Mundu angubadilisa mapesa</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Akaghola hyatu gha ngoi, akawatimula wogha panji gha lyugha lighuta lya Sapanga pamonga na kondolu na ng'ombi wa weni, akabidula mesa na kutaghilila kutali mapesa ghao, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />akawalongela wala wawelili wanguwusa ngunda, “Muyahumisi hagha. Mkotoho kughola lighuta lya Tati wa nenga kuwela mahala pakuwusila vindu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Wavulwa ghaki waikumbukwile yiwa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Upalo ghangu kulighuta lyako uteni nyanya mghati ghangu handa lyoto.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ndiwa vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakamkonya Yesu, “Ghani kakulaghila wenga kughola mighalu handa hai?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mlitenyuli lighuta hali lya Sapanga, na nenga nitelichenga kangi kwa lipindi lya machuwa itatu .”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Wala Wayahudi wakalonga, “Lighuta hali lya Sapanga lichengwili kwa lipindi lya machuva ialobaini na isita, ghuli wenga ungulonga utelichenga kwa lipindi lya machuwa itatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ila Lighuta lya Sapanga alilongelili Yesu liwelili ni higha ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Badili gha Yesu kuhinduka, wavulwa ghaki wakumbwikile ghala awelili akilongela na ndiwa wakayakwinila Mayandiko gha Sapanga na milando hyogha awelili akilongela.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumanya mioyu gha wandu wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Hinu Yesu paawelili Yelusalemu kumhambu wa Pasaka, wandu watangala wakamkwinila kwa vile walola vilangihi na makangaso ayagholile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ila Yesu kawakwinila ng'ogha kwaikiva awamanyili wogha kwa umaha. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Kahakula ng'ogha mundu yeyosi ili amlongeli vila wandu wawela, kwaikiva awamanyile wandu kinaga ubaga kumioyu ghao.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kuwelili na mundu mmonga akemilwi Nikodemu hayu awelili Mfalisayo na awelili kilongosi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Lichuwa limonga Nikodemu amyendelili Yesu uhiku, akamlongela, “Labi, tungumanya yiwa wenga ni mvula ulaghililwi na Sapanga, kwaikiva kwahela mundu kanguwesa kughola makangaso unguyaghola ikiva Sapanga kapamonga ng'ogha na mweni.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ningukulongela uchakaka, iwesekana ng'ogha mundu kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga ikiva kawelekwa ng'ogha lihanja lya ivili.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu akamkonya, “Anguwesaghuli mundu kuwelekwa akiva mundu mkomi? Ghuli anguwesa kuyingila mumtima wa nyongo ghaki akaweleka kangi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akayanga, “Ningukulongela uchakaka, ikiva mundu kaweleka ng'ogha kwa masi na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, anguwesa ng'ogha kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mundu anguweleka kihigha na tati pamonga na nyongo, ila wandu wangughalambuswa na kuwela wana wa Sapanga na Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Hinu ukotoho kukangasa kwa kukulongela yiwa ungupalwa uwelekwi lihanja lya ivili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Luyegha linguwumba kuyenda kula lingupala, na lilowi lyaki linguhyoghanika ila uwesa ng'ogha kumanya kula linguhuma wala kula linguyenda, hilahila na mundu awelikilwi na Mpumulo uwela nagha.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu akamkonya, “Mghalu hau unguwesekanaghuli?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamlongela, “Wenga ni mvula mkola mlima ku Izilaeli, ghuli mighalu hagha unguyamanya ng'ogha?” <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ningukulongela wenga chakaka, tungulongela kila tukimanya na tungutangasa kila tukilolile kwa mihu, ila mwenga mjumila ng'ogha ujumbi wa twenga. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ikiva niwalongela mighalu yangugholeka ku mlima wogha mwenga mnikwinila ng'ogha, mtewesaghuli kunikwinila nikiwalongela mighalu gha kundumba? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kwahela mundu kayenda kundumba ila Mwana wa Mundu, avile kahuluka kuhuma kundumba.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Handa vila Musa paayinulili kunani njoka wa shaba kula kulivagha, na Mwana wa Mundu ateyinuliwa kunani vila vila, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ili kila mundu yamukwinila aweli na ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwaikiva Sapanga apalili nesu mlima wogha hata akamuhumisa Mwana ghaki wa weka, lukani kila mundu mweni kumkwinila hayu Mwana akotoho kuyaghamila, ila apokeli ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwaikiva Sapanga kamyegha ng'ogha Mwana ghaki kutosa mlima wogha, ila kuulokola.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yeyosi angumkwinila Mwana angulamulwa ng'ogha, ila yula kamkwinila ng'ogha katoswa kala, kwaikiva kamkwinila ng'ogha Mwana wa weka wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Utoso weni ndiwa hau, mhana uhikili kumilimawogha ila wandu wakapala lwigha kupiti mhana, kwaikiva mighalu ghao ni mihakata. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kwaikiva kila yula angughola mahakata anguhyomela hau mhana na wala kahika ng'ogha kumhana, ili mighalu ghaki ikotoho kuloleka lipala lipala. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ila wala wangughola yala yawela gha chakaka wanguhika kumhana, lukani yala wayaghola yalangihi yiwa wamyitikila Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Badili gha hagha, Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wayendili mbaka kumbwani wa Yudasia wakatama haku pamonga machuwa mayaghani, na kubatisa wandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana na mweni awelili akibatisa wandu haku Ainoni kula pabehi na ku Selemu, ingumanyika haku kuwelili na masi yatangala, wandu watangala wamyendelili na mweni akawabatisa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Lipindi hali Yohana awelili ambila kawopwa ng'ogha mlighuta lya wawopwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Hinu pahumilili masindano paghati gha wavulwa wa Yohana na Myahudi mmonga kwaikiva gha kuliwofula pambila gha kuyupa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Hinu wavulwa wala wakamyendela Yohana na kumlongela, “Mvula, yula mundu awelili pamonga na wenga kumwambu gha lweni Yolidani, na wenga uilongilie mighalu ghaki, hinaa angubatisa na wandu watangala wangumyendela.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana akawayanga, “Iwesekana ng'ogha mundu kuwela na kindu ikiwela Sapanga kampegha ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mwenga maweni baha ni walangihi wa nenga kwaikiva niilongile, ‘Nenga ng'ogha kilisito ila niyeghwa ili nimlongoleli.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mdala mweni kuposwa kanguwela wa bambu wa uposo, ila ghanja ghaki bambu wa uposo yula kagholoka pabehi na kuhyoghanila kuhuma kwa mweni, anguhekelela nesu paahyoghanila lilowi lya bambu wa uposo. Mghalu hau ungunihekelesa nesu. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ingumpala Yesu awoneki mkulu nesu, na nenga niwoneki mnung'una nesu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mweni kuhuma kundumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mwana wa Sapanga kahika kuhuma kundumba ni mkulu apiti wogha, na yula ahuma kumlimawogha ni wa mlima wogha na angulongela mighalu gha mlima wogha. Ila yula anguhika kuhuma kundumba ni mkulu apiti wogha. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Mweni angulonga ghala kayalola na kuyahyoghanila kuhuma kwa Sapanga, ila wandu mayaghani hela ndiwa weni kukwinila ujumbi ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ila mundu yeyosi kakwinila ujumbi ghaki anguhighilisa ghala angulongela Sapanga ni gha chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yula kayeghwa na Sapanga angulonga milando gha Sapanga kwaikiva Sapanga angumpegha mundu hayu Mpumulo ghaki ili amlongosi kwa kila kindu angukighola na kulonga. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tati angumpala Mwana na kampegha kila kindu akigholokeli. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mundu yula kamukwinila Mwana kana ukomu wa machuwa hyoga bila mwihu, na yula kamkwinila ng'ogha Mwana atewela ng'ogha na ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, kwaikiva Sapanga ateyendelela kuwela na lilaka na mundu hayu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mdala wa ku Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo wahyoghanilili yiwa Yesu awelili angubatisa na anguwaghola wandu watangala kuwela wavulwa ghaki kupiti Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Hata nagha uchakaka ni yiwa Yesu kabatisa ng'ogha ila wavulwa ghaki ndiwa wawelili wangubatisa. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Hinu Yesu pakahyoghanila hagha, akahuma ku Yudasia na kuhuya kumlima wa Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kumwanja hau impalili apitili kumlima wa Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Hinu, akahika ku Sikali, mmbwani mmonga wa Samalia, pabehi na litawa lila Yakobu awelili kampegha mwana ghaki akemilwi Yusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Pala mahala kuwelili na litepu lya Yakobu, na mweni Yesu, kwaikiva awelili katoka na mwanja, akatama mmbali gha litepu. Iwelili isaa isita pamuhi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Akahika mdala mmonga wa ku Samalia kuteka masi. Yesu akamlongela, “Nipeghi masi nyweghi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Lipindi hali wavulwa ghaki wawelili wayenda mmbwani kuhemela mulyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Hinu yula mdala akamlongela, “Wenga ni Myahudi na nenga ni mdala Msamalia! Iwesekanaghuli kuniluwa masi?” Alongili nagha kwaikiva Wayahudi wangujambusana ng'ogha na wangughola ng'ogha chochosi kwa pamonga na Wasamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Handa ungalimanya kindu Sapanga kanguwesa kukupegha, na ni ghani kangukuluwa hinaa masi gha kunywegha, wenga ndiwa ungamluwa masi na mweni angalikupegha masi gha ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yula mdala akamlongela, “Bambu, uwela ng'ogha na kitekelo kya kutekela masi na litepu ni litali nesu hinu hagha masi yeni kuwapegha wandu ukomu uteyatola kugha?” <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ghuli wenga ni mkulu kupiti mbuyi wa twenga Yakobu, mweni atupeghili litepu hali na mwenibaha akanywegha masi ghaki, na wanaghaki, pamonga na mikokolu ghaki?<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu akamyanga, “Kila mundu mweni kunywegha masi hagha yeni kuhuma mulitepu hali atewela na kuyumilila kangi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />“Ila yeyosi atenywegha masi ghala nitempegha nenga ateyumililwa ng'ogha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Masi ghala nitempegha nenga yatewela mghati mwaki handa uhimbuki weni kuyuma ng'ogha mghati mwaki utempegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Yula mdala akamlongela, “Bambu unipeghi masi hagha, ili nikotoho kuyumilwa kangi na nileki kuhika kangi kuteka masi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamlongela yula mdala, “Uyendi ukamkemi mngwana ghako ahiki pamonga na wenga baha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yula mdala akamyanga, “Nenga niwela ng'ogha na mlumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu akamlongela, “Uilongile chakaka, yiwa uwela ng'ogha na mngwana.” <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwaikiva uposilwi kala na wangwana waitano na yula mngwana angulikala na wenga kamngwana ghako ng'ogha. Yala ulongili ni chakaka, “Uwela ng'ogha na mngwana.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yula mdala akamlongela, “Bambu, ningulola wenga ni mlota wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Akayendela kulonga, “Watati wa twenga wawelili wanguyupa kulitumbi hali, ila mwenga Wayahudi mngulonga mahala pakumyupila Sapanga ni haku Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamlongela, “Mdala, unikwinili, lisaa linguhika mtewela ng'ogha mkimyupa Tati kunani gha litumbi hali, hata kula Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwenga Wasamalia mungumtundamila yula mummanyile ng'ogha, ila twenga tungummanya hayu tungumyupa, kwaikiva ulokola unguhuma kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ila lipindi linguhika, kangi lihika kala, yiwa wandu wenikupala kumyupa Sapanga kwa uchakaka, watemyupa Tati handa vila Mpumulo ghaki anguwalangiha, kumyupa mweni vila kawela chakaka. Kwaikiva Tati anguwapala wandu wamyupi Sapanga kwa ndambu hai. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />“Sapanga ni Mpumulo na wogha wangumyupa, mweni wangupalwa kumyupa Sapanga ku Upumulo na chakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yula mdala akamlongela, “Ningumanya yiwa anguhika masihi, ingumaanisa Kilisito mweni atehika, atetulongela mighalu hyogha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu akamlongela, “Nenga mwenikulongela na wenga ndiwa Kilisito.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Bahala wavulwa ghaki wakahuya walikangasili nesu kulola angulongela na mdala. Ila kwahela mundu yeyosi mweni kumkonya mdala, “Ungupala kyani” au kumkonya Yesu, “Kwa kyani ungulongela na mdala?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yula mdala akaleka ndeleku ghaki pala, akayenda kummbwani kuwalongela wandu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Muhiki mumloli mundu anilongilile mighalu hyogha nigholili. Ghuli, walongo inguwesekana hayu ndiwa Kilisito?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Hinu wandu watangala wakahuma mmbwani, wakamyendela Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Lipindi lilalila wavulwa ghaki wakamlongela Yesu, “Mvula pepayi ulyeghi mulyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ila Yesu akawalongela “Nenga niwela na mulyo muumanya ng'ogha mwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Hinu wavulwa ghaki wakakonyana, “Ghuli kuwela na mundu kamyeghela kala mulyo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mulyo wa nenga ni kughola kila angukipala yula aniyeghili kughola na kulitimilisa lihengu lyaki.” <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwenga mngulonga, “Ihighala miehi minjechi hela, lipindi lya mabeno kuhika!” Ila nenga ninguwalongela, mloli mabeno vila yapia kala. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mweni kubena angupokela hupo ghaki na angukungula mabeno kwaikiva gha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, hinu mweni kubena na mkulila mbeyu watehekelela pamonga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwaikiva gha nagha lilando hali ni chakaka, “Mundu mmonga angukulila na mghangi angubena.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nenga niwalaghilili myendi kubena mabeno muyakulila ng'ogha. “Wandu waghangi wagholili lihengu litopa, ila mwenga mungulinoma kupitila lihuki lya weni.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamalia watangala kuhuma kummbwani hula wakamkwinila Yesu kwaikiva gha milando aiyalongile yula nyongu, “Anilongelili mighalu hyogha nigholili.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Wasamalia wamuyendelili Yesu wakamluwa alikali na weni, akalikala kummbwani hula machuwa maivili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wandu watangala nesu wakakwinila kwaikiva gha ujumbi ghaki Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Wakamlongela yula nyongo, “Twenga tukwinila ng'ogha kwaikiva gha milando gha wenga, twenga wenibaha tuyoghanila na tungumanya yiwa hayu ndiwa mlokola wa mlima wogha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mwana wa kilongosi mmonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Badili gha machuwa ivili Yesu ahukili pala, akayenda kummbwani Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu mwenibaha awelili kalonga yiwa, “Mlota wa Sapanga angutundamilwa ng'ogha kumlima ghaki.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Hinu Yesu paahikili ku mlima wa Galilaya, na Wagalilaya watangala wakampokela, kwaikiva na weni hilahila wawelili wayenda Yelusalemu kumhambu wa Pasaka, na haku walolile mighalu aigholile Yesu haku.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu paayendile kangi kula Kana, kummbwani wa Galilaya, pala mahala aghalambulili masi kuwela divai, kuwelili na kilongosi mmonga mwenikuwela na mwana mvina kula Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Hinu, hayu kilongosi pakahyoghanila yiwa Yesu awelili kahuma ku Yudasia na kuhika ku Galilaya, akamuyendela na kumluwa ayendi kumlamisa mwana ghaki awelili mvina ndemba ndemba. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela, “Mwenga pamlola ng'ogha kilangihi na makangaso katu mtekwinila ng'ogha!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yula kilongosi akamlongela, “Bambu, pepayi tuyendi pambila gha mwana ghangu kahova.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamlongela, “Uyendi hela, mwana ghako atewela mkomu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Kilongosi yula akakwinila lila lilando alongelilwi na Yesu, akayenda zyaki. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Paawelili akali mnjila, watumikila ghaki wakakongane na mweni, wakamlongela yiwa “Mwana ghako kawela mkomu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Hinu akawakonya, “Lisaa lininga mwana hayu aitumbulile kuwela maha,” weni wakamlongela, “Lichu lisaa isaba pamuhi, kulwala kukahuka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Hinu tati ghaki akumbwikile iwelili ni lisaa lilalila Yesu paamlongilile, “Mwana ghako atelama.” Pala akamkwinila Yesu pamonga na wogha wa mulighuta lyaki.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Haki kiwelili kilangihi kya ivili akigholili Yesu paawelili anguhuma ku Yudasia kuyenda ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu kulibosi lya Betizata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Badili gha hagha Yesu akayenda kumbwani wa Yelusalemu kwaikiva gha mhambu wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Haku Yelusalemu, pabehi na mlyango ungukemwa mlyango wa kondolu, kuwelili na libosi lya masi lingukemwa kwa kiebulania Betizata, liwelili litindilwa na mikuta maitano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Hamu mikuta muwelili na wavina watangala, wangali kulola na walemafu na wapolili vikongonu. Wawelili wakilindila masi yatimbulilwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />kwaikiva lipindi litenu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga awelili akihuluka mlibosi na kuyatimbula ghala masi na yula mvina wa mtumbulo kuyingila mghati badili gha masi kutimbuka angulama uvina kawela nau. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Hinu, pala pawelili na mundu mmonga awelili mvina kwa machuva iselasini na inane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu paamlolili yula mundu kawonja na akimanya awelili kawela mvina kwa lipindi litali akamkonya, “Ghuli ungupala kulamiswa?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yula mvina akamyanga, “Bambu, nenga nahela mundu wa kunivika ku libosi, masi payatimbulwa lipindi paniyesa kuyingila, mundu ghangi angunilongolela kuyingila mlibosi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ugholoki, ulitwiki lihinda lyaku uyendi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bwitu hayu mundu akalama, akatola lihinda lyaki akatyanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">matendu hagha yagholeka lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Hinu vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakamlongela yula mundu alamisilwi, “Lelu ni lichuwa lya kupumulila, laghililo lingukulekesela ng'ogha wenga kupapa lihinda.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ila mweni akawalongela, “Yula mundu anilamisili ndiwa kanilongela, ‘Ulitwiki lihinda lyaku’ na uyendi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Hinu wakamkonya, “Hayu mundu akulongilili, ulitwiki lihinda lyako uyendi ni ghani?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ila mweni kammanya ng'ogha yula mundu amlamisili, kwaikiva Yesu awelili kahuka kala mahala pala, na hilahila pawelili na lipinga likulunga lya wandu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ila kuulongolo mayaghani Yesu akamlola yula mundu mghati gha Lighuta lya Sapanga, akamlongela, “Hinaa ulama kala, ukotoho kughola sambi kangi, ili ukotoho kuhikilwa na mghalu mghangi mhakata upiti hau.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Hayu mundu akayenda, akawalongela vilongosi wa Wayahudi yiwa Yesu ndiwa kanilamisa. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Wayahudi wakatumbula kumghasa Yesu kwaikiva agholile mghalu hula lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu akawayanga, “Tati ghangu angughola lihengu lipindi lyogha hata lelo, na nenga ningughola lihengu bila kuleka.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwaikiva gha milando hagha, vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakahyoma nesu, wakatumbula kuhakula njila gha kumkoma Yesu, ng'ogha kwaikiva atenyulile laghililo lya lichuwa lya kupumulila weka, ila hilahila alongili yiwa Sapanga ni Tati ghaki na hinu kuighola handa Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uweso wa Mwana wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akawalongela, “Uchakaka ninguwalongela, Mwana anguwesa ng'ogha kughola lolosi mwenibaha, ila mweni anguwesa kughola lila amlolile Tati ghaki akighola. Kwaikiva lolosi angulighola Tati, Mwana hilahila angughola.” <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Tati angumpala Mwana na angumlangiha kila kindu angukighola mweni baha, kangi atemlangiha mighalu mikulunga na kuighola kupiti hagha na mwenga mtekangaswa nesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Handa vila Tati anguhindula wahovili na kuwapegha ukomu, hilahila na mweni Mwana anguwapegha ukomu wala anguwapala. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tati angumtosa ng'ogha mundu yeyosi, ila kamghola Mwana awatosi wandu wogha. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Ili wandu wogha wapati kumtundamila Mwana handa vila wangumtundamila Tati. Yeyosi mweni kumtundamila ng'ogha Mwana, kanguwesa ng'ogha kumtundamila yula mweni kumlaghila.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ninguwalongela chakaka, yula angulihyoghanila lilando lya nenga, na kumkwinila yula aniyeghili nenga, hayu kana ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, atetoswa ng'ogha, kahubhuka kala kuhuma kukihu na kuyingila kuukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, lipindi linguhika na kangi lihika kala, wala wabhaghulwa kutali na Sapanga wateyoghanila lilowi lya Mwana wa Sapanga, na weni kuhyoghanila, watelama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Handa vila Tati kawela na makakala gha kuwapegha wandu ukomu, hilahila kamghola Mwana awapeghi wandu ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kangi Sapanga kampegha Mwana ghaki makakala gha kutosa kwaikiva mweni ni Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mkotoho kulikangasa kuhyoghanila hagha, kwaikiva lipindi linguhika wandu wogha wa mmambi wateliyoghanila lilowi lyaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Weni watehinduka na kuhuku kumamambi ghao wala weni kughola matendu maha na kulama, na wala wagholili uhakata watehinduka na kutoswa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguilongela mweni kwa ghala anguyaghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Nenga ninguwesa ng'ogha kughola mghalu wowosi weka ghangu. Nenga ningutosa vila nihyoghanila kuhuma kwa Tati, na utoso wa nenga ni wa chakaka. Lukasini lwa nenga ng'ogha kughola nilipala mwenibaha, ila lila angulipala yula aniyeghili.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Ikiva ninguilongela mweni, milando ninguilongela itewoneka ng'ogha yiwa ni gha chakaka.” <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ila kuwela na mundu ghangi mweni kulongela habali zya nenga kwa mwenga, nenga ningumanya yiwa hyogha ayalongile kwa habali gha nenga ni chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwenga mlaghilili wajumbi kwa Yohana na mweni kila awalongelili kwa habali gha nenga ni chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nenga nipala ng'ogha kulongelelwa na mundu, ila ningulongela milando hai lukani mpati kulokolwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana awelili handa limbamba liwelili likiyaka na kulangasa mhana, na mwenga kwa lipindi mayaghani mhekelelili mhana ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ila kuwela na mghulu mkulunga nesu weni kulangiha yiwa nenga ni ghani kupiti ghala awelile kalongela Yohana Mbatisa . Mghalu weni ni ghala mahengu anipeghili Tati niyagholi. Hagha hyogha yangulangiha yiwa nenga ni ghani na yangulangiha yiwa Tati ndiwa mweni kunilaghila. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Mweni Tati aniyeghili kangunilongelela nenga na ghani, ila mwenga mpata ng'ogha kuhyoghanila lilowi lyaki wala kulola vila kawela. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Mwenga mvika ng'ogha lilando lyaki kumioyu kwaikiva mumkwinila ng'ogha yula amyeghili kwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwenga mnguyangala kuyalolesa Mayandiko gha Sapanga mkiwachila yiwa mghati ghaki mtepokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na mayandiko hagha yangunilongelela nenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ila mwenga mngupala ng'ogha kuhika kwa nenga ili mpokeli hau ukomu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Lukasini lwangu ng'ogha kusifilwa na wandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ila ninguwamanya mwenga vila muwela kumioyu yiwa mungumpala ng'ogha Sapanga mumioyu gha mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ila nenga nihika kwa uweso wa Tati ghangu, mwenga mnipokela ng'ogha, ila mundu ghangi paahika kwa uweso ghaki mweni, mtempokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwenga munguwesaghuli kunikwinila ikiva mungupala kulisifila weni kwa weni, na mleka kuhakula utundamilu weni kuhuma kwa Sapanga mweni? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mkotoho kuliwachila yiwa nenga nitewasitaki kwa Tati. Ila Musa yula mwenga mungumtegemela ndiwa atewasitaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Handa chakaka mungalimkwinila Musa, mungalinikwinila na nenga kwaikiva Musa ayandikile habali gha nenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ila handa mukwinila ng'ogha ghala ayandikili Musa, hinu mtewesaghuli, kukwinila milando gha nenga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awapeghili mulyo wandu ielufu mhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Badili gha hagha Yesu akahubhuka kulihiwa Galilaya lihina lyaki lighangi lingukemwa lihiwa Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lipinga likulunga lya wandu likamkovekela kwaikiva walolili makangaso agholili kwa kuwalamisa wavina. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Hinu Yesu akakwela kulitumbi akatama pamonga na wavulwa ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Lipindi hali mhambu wa Wayahudi waukema pasaka uwelili pabehi kuhika. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Hinu Yesu paalolili lipinga likulunga lya wandu lingumhikila, akamlongela Filipo “Tutehemela kugha mibumunda ili wandu hagha wawesi kulyegha?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Alongile nagha kwa kumyesa Filipo, kwaikiva amanyili kala lila atelighola.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo akamyanga, “Ghuli, wenga unguliwachila ng'ogha yiwa kutepalwa kuwela na msahala wa lichuva lyogha kwa mundu mmonga kuhemela libumunda kwa kila mmonga apati mayaghani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mmonga wa wavulwa ghaki akemilwi Andelea, hayu awelili mlongu ghaki Simoni Petelo, akamlongela Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />Andelea akalonga, “Baha kuwela na msongolo, mmonga kana mibumunda mihano gha shayili na vihomba vinung'una viivili, ila havi vitekwila niki kwa wandu watangala handa hagha?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akalonga, “Muwatamisi wandu.” Na mahala pala pawelili na manyahi mahupi hupi. Lipinga lila liwelili na walumi ielufu mhano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu akatola hila mibumunda, akamshukwile Sapanga, akawapegha wandu wawelili watama pala, akaghola hilahila kwa wala homba, kila mundu akapokela handa apalili kulyegha. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Wandu pawayukwite Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Mkunguli mulyo uhighalili ili ukotoho kuyaghamila chochose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Hinu wavulwa wakakungula vipandi vya mibumunda na homba wahighalili na kumemesa vibeja ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Hinu wandu wala pawalolili mkangaso hula augholili Yesu, wakailongela, “Chakaka, mundu hayu ndiwa mlota wa Sapanga yula tumuwachililile atehika kumlimawogha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu akimanya yiwa waipalile kumtola wamgholi nkosi ghao, akahuka kangi, akayenda kulitumbi weka ghaki.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutyanga kunani gha masi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayu 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliku 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Paiwela lumihi wavulwa wa Yesu wakahuluka kuyenda kulihiwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Lipindi lila lwigha liyingilili kala na Yesu awelili kahika ng'ogha ili aweli na weni, wakakwela whatu ili wahubhuki kuyenda Kapelinaumu, <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Liyegha likalipa liwelili linguwumba na masi gha lihiwa yakatumbula kutimbuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wavulwa wa Yesu wayendelelili kuulongolo kunu wakitova mbondu kuutali wa kilomita itano au isita, wamwonili Yesu akityanga kunani gha masi, anguhika pabehi na whatu, wakatila nesu. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Ni nenga, mkotoho kutila.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Hinu kwa luheku wakamkalibisa Yesu muwhatu na lipindi mayaghani whatu hila ikahika kumlima myumu wawelili wanguyenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wangumhaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Kilau ghaki lipinga lya wandu wala wahighalili mbandi gha ivili gha lihiwa ndiwa wakamanya yiwa kuwelili na whatu imonga hela pala na Yesu kayingila ng'ogha ku whatu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki, ila wavulwa wawelili wayenda weka ghao. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Wandu waghangi wakahika na whatu zighangi kuhuma Tibelia, wakahika kumahala pala walyeghili hila mibumunda badili gha Yesu kumshukwile Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Hinu wala wandu pawamanyili yiwa Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wawela ng'ogha mahala pala, wakakwela muwhatu zila, wakayenda ku Kapelinaumu wakimhaka.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiwa libumunda lya ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Wala wandu pawamlola Yesu kumwambu gha ivili gha lihiwa wakamkonya, “Mvula uhikili ligha haku?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akawayanga, “Uchakaka ninguwalongela, mungunihaka ng'ogha nenga kwa vila muwonili makakangaso, ila kwaikiva mlyeghili hila mibumunda na mkayukwite. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mkotoho kughola mahengu kwaikiva gha kupokela mulyo weni kuwola, ila mgholi mahengu kwaikiva gha milyo weni kuwola ng'ogha, mulyo hau utewapegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu kuhuma kwa Sapanga. Mwana wa Mundu ndiwa atewapegha mulyo hau, kwaikiva Tati Sapanga kampegha uweso wa kughola nagha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ndiwa weni wakamkonya, “Tugholi kyani ili tuwesi kughola lila Sapanga angulipala?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mghalu angupala Sapanga muugholi ni kunikwinila nenga mweni kulaghilwa na mweni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Hinu wakamlongela, “Uteghola mkangaso liki ili tukiloli tupati kukukwinila? Uteghola mghalu ghani?” <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Wambuyi wa twenga walyeghili mulyo wenikukemwa mana kula kulivagha, handa vila iyandikilwi, “Awapeghili mibumunda kuhuma kundumba ili walyeghi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu akawalongela, “Uchakaka ninguwalongela, Musa kawapegha ng'ogha libumunda kuhuma kundumba, ila ni Tati wa nenga avile hinaa anguwapegha mwenga libumunda lya chakaka kuhuma kundumba.” <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />“Kwaikiva libumunda lya Sapanga ni yula anguhuluka kuhuma kundumba ili awapeghi wandu wa mlima wogha ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Hinu wakamlongela, “Bambu, kuhumila lelu utupeghi hali libumunda machuwa hyogha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nenga ndiwa libumunda linguwapegha ukomo, mundu atehika kwa nenga na kukwinila hayu atekolwa ng'ogha na njala, na kuyumililwa ng'ogha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ila handa niwalongilile yiwa mnilola ila mmbila kunikwinila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wogha wala angunipegha Tati watehika kwa nenga, na yula ahika kwa nenga nitemuwinga ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwaikiva nenga nihuluka ng'ogha kuhuma kundumba ili nigholi kila ningukipala nenga, ila nigholi kila angukipala Sapanga mweni kunilaghila. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Hagha ndiwa angupala Sapanga mweni kunilaghila, nikotoho myaghamisa hata mmonga paghati gha wala anipeghili ila niwahinduli wogha lichuwa lya mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />“Kwaikiva kila angukipala Tati wa nenga ndiwa haki yiwa yula kamlola Mwana na kumkwinila aweli na ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na nenga nitewahindula lichuwa lya mwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Hinu Wayahudi wakatumbula kung'ung'ulika kwa vila Yesu alongile, “Nenga ndiwa libumunda lila lihuluka kuhuma kundumba.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Wakalonga, “Ghuli, hayu ng'ogha Yesu mwana wa Yusufu? Tungummanya tati ghaki na nyongu ghaki! Hinu anguwesaghuli kulonga yiwa kahuluka kuhuma kundumba?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mkotoho kuling'ung'ula weni kwa weni.” <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kwahela mundu kanguwesa kuhika kwa nenga ikiva Tati yula mweni kunilaghila kamlongosa ng'ogha kuhika kwa nenga, na nenga nitemuhindula lichuwa lya kumwihu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Kukihitabu kya Sapanga mlota mmonga wa Sapanga ayandikili, “Wandu wogha watevulwa na Sapanga.” Hinu kila yula angumhyoghanila Sapanga na kujivula kuhuma kwa Tati anguhika kwa nenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Hai ingumanisa ng'ogha yiwa kuwela na mundu amlolile Tati, ila mweni weka yaki ndiwa amwonili Tati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ninguwalongela uchakaka, yula angunikwinila kana ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nenga ndiwa libumunda lya ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Wambuyi wa mwenga walyeghili mana kula kulivagha ila wakahwegha. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ila hali ni libumunda weni kuhuluka kuhuma kundumba ili yoyosi atelyegha akotoho kuhwegha. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />“Nenga ndiwa libumunda lyeni kuyegha ukomu lila lihuluka kuhuma kundumba, mundu yoyosi paalyegha libumunda hali atelikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Na libumunda ningumpegha ni higha ghangu hau niteupegha kwaikiva gha ukomu wa wandu wa mlima wogha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Hinu Wayahudi wakatumbula kusindana milando weni kwa weni wakilonga, “Anguwesaghuli mundu hayu kutupegha twenga higha ghaki tulyeghi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Uchakaka, ninguwalongela, pamlyegha ng'ogha higha gha Mwana wa Mundu na kunywegha mwahi ghaki, mtewela ng'ogha na ukomu mghati mwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mundu yoyosi angulyegha higha gha nenga na kunywegha mwahi gha nenga kana ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Nenga nitemhindula lichuwa lya mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwaikiva higha gha nenga ni mulyo wa chakaka, na mwahi ghangu ni kinywegha kya chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yeyosi mweni kulyegha higha gha nenga na kunywegha mwahi gha nenga, atelikala mghati mwa nenga na nenga nitelikala mghati ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tati mweni ukomu kanilaghila nenga, na nenga ningulama kwaikiva gha Tati, hinu yula angunilyegha nenga atelama kwaikiva gha nenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hinu, hali ndiwa libumunda lihuluka kuhuma kundumba, na hali ng'ogha lila libumunda wambuyi wa mwenga walyeghili kuluvagha hata nagha wakahova. Yula atelyegha libumunda hali atelama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu alongile milando hai pawelili akivula ku mlighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi haku kapelinahumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando yeni kuyegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Hinu watangala wa wavulwa ghaki pawayughanila wakalonga, “Mavulo hagha yangumanyikana ng'ogha kiuyuyughu. Ni ghani atewesa kuyapokela?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu amanyili bila kulongelwa na mundu yiwa wavulwa ghaki wangung'ung'ulikila lilando hali linguwahyomesa, akawakonya, “Ghuli, mghalu hau linguwaghola muweli na mang'ung'uliko? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Itewelaghuli hinu, pamumlola Mwana wa Mundu akikwela kuyenda kula awelili mtumbula? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga ndiwa yula mweni kuyegha ukomu, higha unguwesa ng'ogha chochosi. Milando niwalongilile ni milando yenikuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga na yanguyegha ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Hata nagha, kuwela na wandu paghati gha mwenga weni kukwinila ng'ogha.” Yesu ailongile nagha kwaikiva aimanyile kuhuma mtumbulo ni mkina ghani weni kukwinila ng'ogha, na vilavila ni ghani yula atemhyuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Hinu akayendelela kulonga, “Kwaikiva gha nagha niwalongelili yiwa kwahela mundu kanguwesa kuhika kwa nenga akiva kalongoswa ng'ogha na Tati ghangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kuhumila lipindi lila wavulwa ghaki watangala wahuyili kuhyetu, wakaleka kutyanga na mweni kangi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela wala ikumi na ivili, “Ghuli na mwenga mngupala kuhuka vila vila?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petelo akayanga, “Bambu, tuhuki tuyendi kwa ghani? Wenga uwela na milando gha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />“Twenga tungukwinila na tumanya yiwa wenga ndiwa yula mhaghulwa mweni kuhuma kwa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ghuli, niwahaghula ng'ogha mwenga ikumi na ivili? Hata nagha, mmonga wa mwenga angulongoswa na Lihyukana.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu angulongela hagha kwa habali gha Yudasi, mwana wa Simoni yula ahikili kumyuka, pamonga na yiwa awelili mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na walongu ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Badili gha mighalu hagha, Yesu atyangili kumahala wekaweka gha kumlima wa Galilaya. Kalema kuyenda ku Uyahudi kwaikiva vilongosi wa haku wapalili kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Hilahila lipindi lya mhambu wa Wayahudi weni kukemwa mhambu wa vibimilo uwelili pabehi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Hinu walongu ghaki Yesu wakamlongela, “Uhuki haku, uyendi Yudasia, ili wavulwa ghako wawesi kulola lihengu lyaku lila ungulighola.” <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />“Kwaikiva kwahela mundu kangupala kuwela mkola mlima akaghola mighalu ghaki kwa kulihigha, ikiva angupala kuwela mkola mlima ingumpala agholi mighalu ghaki lipalalipala, hinu ujihighilisi kumlimawogha kwa kila ungukighola.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Walongo ghaki wailongile nagha kwaikiva pamonga na yiwa weni ni walongo ghaki ila wamkwinilili ng'ogha.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ndiwa Yesu akawalongela, “Lipindi lya nenga lyambila kuhika kuyenda haku Yelusalemu, ila mwenga mnguwesa kuyenda lipindi lolosi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Wandu wa mlima wogha hau wanguwesa ng'ogha kuwahyomela mwenga, ila nenga wangunihyomela kwaikiva nenga ninguwalongela chakaka kwaikiva gha matendu ghao mahakata. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />“Mwenga myendi kumhambu hau, nenga ninguyenda ng'ogha kumuhambu hau kwaikiva lipindi lyangu lyambila kuhika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu pakayomola kulongela hagha akahighala kumlima wa Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kumhambu wa vibimilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Badili gha walongu ghaki kulongola kuyenda kumuhambu hilahila na Yesu akayenda ila kwa kifisu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Lipindi lya mhambu vilongosi wa Wayahudi wawelili wakimuhakula wakikonya wandu, “Kakugha mundu hayu wangumkema Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Amonga gha wandu paghati gha lipinga lya wandu lyeni kuwela pala wakawela wangulipwepa wakilonga, “Huyu mundu kamaha,” na waghangi wakawela wakilonga, “Ng'ogha anguwabyodosa wandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Hinu kukawela ng'ogha mundu mweni kuwesa kumlongilela kwa lilowi likulunga, kwaikiva wawelili wanguwatila vilongosi wa Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mhambu hau pauhika paghati, Yesu akayingila Kulighuta lya Sapanga, akatumbula kuvula. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Hinu Wayahudi wakalikangasa nesu na kulonga, “Mundu hayu katola kugha mavulo hagha na mweni kayenda ng'ogha kushuli?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Hinu Yesu akawayanga, “Mavulo hagha ninguyavula ghanenga ng'ogha ila yanguhuma kwa Sapanga mweni kuniyegha.” <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mundu mweni kupala kughola ghala angupala Sapanga, atemanya yiwa mavulo ghangu yanguhuma kwa Sapanga au ninguilongela mweni handa mweni. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mundu mweni kulongela mweni handa mweni angupala asifilwi mwenibaha, ila yula mwenikupala yula kanilaghila asifilwi, hayu mundu ni mchakaka na ng'ogha mhwangi. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ghuli, “Musa kawapegha ng'ogha laghililo? Hata nagha kwahela hata mundu mmonga paghati gha mwenga kakola hagha malaghilo. Kwa kyani mngupala kunikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Bahala lila lipinga lya wandu likamyanga, “Uwela na lihoka wenga. Ghani angupala kukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akawayanga, “Nigholili mkangasu mmonga kulichuwa lya kupumulila na hau uwakangasili mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa awapeghili mwenga laghililo lya kuyingiswa jandu wana wa mwenga walumi, kiuchakaka laghililo hali lihuma ng'ogha kwa Musa, ila kwa mambui wa mwenga. Ila mwenga munguyingisa wana wa mwenga jandu hata kulichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Hinu Ikiwela, mundu anguyingiswa jandu lichuwa lya kupumulila lukani laghililo likotoho kutenyulwa, kwa kyani mngunihyomela kwa kumlamisa mundu lichuwa lya kupumulila? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />“Mumtosi mundu kwa chakaka na vila ingupalwa kumtosa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghuli Yesu ndiwa Kilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wamonga gha wandu wa Yelusalemu wakonyili, “Ghuli hayu ng'ogha yula mundu vilongosi wa twenga wangupala kumkoma?” <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mloli hinaa, angulongela lipalalipala na kwahela mundu kalongela lolosi. Ghuli, inguwesekana vilongosi wangumanya uchakaka yiwa hayu ndiwa Kilisito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kilisito paatehika, “Kwahela mundu atemanya kahumila kugha, ila twenga tungumanya yiwa hayu mundu anguhuma kugha.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Hinu, Yesu paawelili anguvula kulyugha lya lighuta lya Sapanga, akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Mwenga mngunimanya na mungukumanya kula ninguhuma. Nenga nihika ng'ogha kwa kuliyegha mweni, ila yula kaniyegha ni wachakaka na mwenga mungummanya ng'ogha.” <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />“Ila nenga ningummanya kwaikiva ninguhuma kwa mweni, na mweni ndiwa kanilaghila.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ndiwa, wandu wakahakula kumkola, ila kwahela mundu ayesili kumkamula kwaikiva lipindi lyake liwelili lyambila kuhika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Wandu watangala kulila lipinga wamkwinilili, wakalonga, “Ghuli kilisito paatehika ateghola vilangihi vikulunga nesu kupiti havi anguvighola hayu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagholokela wangulaghilwa kumkamula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo wayoghanilili wandu wakipwepa milando hila yeni kumlongelelela Yesu. Hinu, weni pamonga na watambika wakulu wakawalaghila wagholokela wamkamuli Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu akalonga, “Nambila niwela na mwenga kwa lipindi mayaghani, na kuulongolo nitehuya kwa yula anilaghilili. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mtenihakula ila mtewesa ng'ogha kunilola, na pala mahala nitewela, mwenga mtewesa ng'ogha kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Wakulu wa Wayahudi wakalongelana weni kwa weni, “Mundu hayu ateyenda kugha hata tuwesi ng'ogha kumhakula na kumlola? Ghuli ateyenda kula kumimbwani gha Ugiliki penikuwela wayetu wangulikala na kuwavula Wagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ghuli, hayu kangupala kutulongela niki paangulonga, ‘Mtenihakula ila mtenilola ng'ogha na mahala pala nitewela, mwenga mtewesa ng'ogha kuhika?’”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milweni gha masi yeni kuyegha ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Lichuwa lya mwihu lya muhambu hula liwelili lichuwa likulunga. Yesu agholokili kuulongolo gha lila lyugha, akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Mula mweni kuyumilwa ahiki kwa nenga anyweghi. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Handa iyandikwa ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga, ‘Yula angunikwinila nenga, atewela na uhimbuko wa masi gha ukomu kumoyu ghaki.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu alongili nagha akimaanisa Mpumulo wa Sapanga yula mwenikuwela wala wenikumkwinila watempokela kuulongolo, lipindi lila hayu Mpumulo awelili kambila kuhika kwaikiva Sapanga awelili kambila kulangiha ukulu wa Yesu paluagha. kuyinulwa kuukulu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wangulekanika kwaikiva gha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Wamonga wa wandu kulila lipinga pawayoghanilili milando hai wakalonga, “Uchakaka mundu hayu ndiwa yula mlota wa Sapanga!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Wamonga wakalonga, “Hayu ndiwa Kilisito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ila wamonga wakalonga, “Inguwesekana ghuli Kilisito akahumila kumlima Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ghuli, Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulongaghuli? Yangulonga, Masihi atehumila kuukolu wa Daudi na atewelekwa ku Betilehemu, mmbwani alikalili Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Hinu, kukahumila mlekanu kukumlongelela Yesu kulila lipinga lya wandu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wamonga wa wandu wapalili kumkamula Yesu, ila kwa hela mundu kayesa kumkamula.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongosi wa Kiyahudi wangumkwinila ng'ogha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Kuulongolo wala wagholokela wakahuya kangi kwa watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo, na weni wakawakonya, “Kwa kyani mumkamula ng'ogha na kumyegha Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wagholokela wakawayanga, “Katu kwahela mundu kawesa kulonga milando handa ailongile mundu hayu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo wakawayanga, “Ghuli mwenga hilahila kawangonga?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ghuli, mungummanya kilongosi yeyosi au Falisayu mweni kumkwinila hayu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />“Ila lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila wangulimanya ng'ogha malaghililo gha Musa, walapilwa na Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Mmonga wa Mafalisayo awelili Nikodemo yula amyendelili Yesu lichuwa limonga uhiku, na mweni akakonya, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ghuli, malaghilo gha twenga yangutukanisa ng'ogha kumtosa mundu pambila gha kumuhyoghanila huti na kumanya ghala agholile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Weni wakamyanga, “Ghuli wenga hilahila unguhuma kumlima wa Galilaya? Hinaa kalolesi ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga mweni utelola yiwa Galilaya katu kuwesa ng'ogha kuhumila mlota wa Sapanga!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Badili gha hagha, wogha wakahuka, kila mundu akayenda ukaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mdala akamulilwi kungongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ila Yesu akayenda kulitumbi lya Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kilau ghaki malawila pee Yesu akayenda kangi kulighuta lya Sapanga. Wandu wogha wakamuyendela, na mweni akatama na kutumbula kuwavula. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo wakamyeghela mdala mmonga akamulilwi akighola ngongola. Wakamgholosa paghati gha lipinga lya wandu wogha. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Hinu wakamlongela Yesu, “Mvula, mdala hayu tumkamula akighola ngongola. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Musa kulilaghilo atulaghilili tumtovwi maganga mbaka ahovi mdala handa hayu. Hinaa wenga ungutulongela niki?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Wailongile nagha ili wapati lilando litewaghola wamsitaki. Ila Yesu akagondama, akayandika pahi kumhanga kwa kyala kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pawayangala kumkonya akayimuka, akawalongela, “Mundu kawela ng'ogha na sambi paghati gha mwenga na aweli wa mtumbulo kumtova liganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Hinu akaghondama kangi na kuyandika kumhanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Pawahyoghanila nagha wakatumbula kutyelembuka mmonga mmonga, wagogolo wakatumbula na waghangi wakakovekela. Yesu akahighala weka ghaki na yula mdala kagholoka palapala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu paayimukili akamkonya yula mdala, “Wakugha wala wandu? Ghuli, kwahela hata mundu mmonga mweni kuhighala ili kukutosa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Yula mdala akamyanga, “Mtundamilwa kwahela hata mmonga,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu akamlongela, “Hata nenga ningukutosa ng'ogha. Uyendi zyako na kuhuma lelo ukotoho kughola uhakata kangi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mhana wa Mlima wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu paalongile kangi naweni, akawalongela, “Nenga ndiwa mhana wa mlima wogha. Mundu mweni kunikovekela nenga angutyanga ng'ogha kulwiha, kangi atewela na mhana weni kumulongosa kuukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Hinu, Mafalisayo wakamlongela, “Wenga unguilongelela umweni, kwa nagha milando unguilongela kwahela mundu mweni kukwinila milando ghako.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akawayanga, “Hata ikawela ninguilongelela mwenibaha, yala ninguyalongela gha uchakaka kwaikiva nenga ningumanya kula nihumili na kula ninguyenda. Ila mwenga mmanya ng'ogha kula nihumili na kula ninguyenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwenga mngutosa mundu kwa mawachilo gha kimundu, ila nenga ningumtosa ng'ogha mundu yeyosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ila panitosa, ningutosa vila ingupalwa kwaikiva nenga naweka ng'ogha, Tati aniyeghili kapamonga na nenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Hilahila kumalaghilo gha mwenga yayandikilwi wandu waivili pawahimulila mghalu hulahula hinu mghalu hau ni chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nenga ninguilongela mwenibaha Tati mweni kunilaghila kangunilongelela handa vila ninguilongelela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Hinu wakamkonya, “Tati ghako kakugha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu akawayanga, “Mwenga mngunimanya ng'ogha nenga ni ghani na Tati ghangu mungummanya ng'ogha. Handa mnganimanya nenga, mngammanya na Tati hilahila.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu ailongile milando hai akiwela anguvula ku Lighuta lya Sapanga kumahala pawelili ngoko gha mapesa. Kwahela mundu kayesa kumkamula, kwaikiva lisaa lyaki liwelili lihika ng'ogha.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongelela kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akawalongela kangi, “Ninguyenda na mwenga, mtenihakula, ila mtehova kusambi syenu. Na kula ninguyenda mwenga munguwesa ng'ogha kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Hinu, wakulu wa Wayahudi walongile, “Ghuli, atelikoma? Kwaikiva kalonga kula ninguyenda mwenga mtewesa ng'ogha kuhika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga mhuma bahapa pahi ila nenga nihuma kunani, mwenga ni wa mlima wogha hau , nenga ng'ogha wa mlima wogha hau. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Niwalongilile yiwa mtehova kusambi syenu, kwaikiva pamkwinila ng'ogha yiwa, ‘Nenga Ndiwa mweni,’ mtehova kusambi syenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Hinu weni wakamkonya, “Wenga ni ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu akawayanga, “Nenga ni yula niwelile nikilongela kuhuma pala niwelile nikiwavula. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Niwela na mighalu itangala gha kuwalongela na kuwatosa mwenga. Ila yula aniyeghili ni wa chakaka, na nenga ninguwalongela wandu wogha mighalu hila niiyoghanilila kuhuma kwa mweni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Weni wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa Yesu awelili akilonga na weni mighalu gha Tati ghaki wa kundumba. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela, “Pamyomola kumyinula Mwana wa Mundu, pala ndiwa mtemanya yiwa ‘Nenga Ndiwa Mweni,’ na yiwa nighola ng'ogha chochosi nenga handa nenga ila ningulonga yala Tati anivulili. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yula aniyeghili kapamonga na nenga, mweni kanileka ng'ogha weka kwaikiva ningughola ghala anguyapala machuwa hyogha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Badili gha kulonga hagha wandu watangala wakamkwinila.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavulwa wachakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela wala Wayahudi weni kumkwinila, “Ikiwela mteyaghola mavulo ghangu mtewela wavulwa ghangu chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Kangi mteumanya uchakaka, na Sapanga atehika kuwavika pekesu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Weni wakamyanga, “Twenga ni wa ukolu wa Ibulahimu na katu tuwela ng'ogha wahusutu wa mundu yoyose. Ungumaanisa liki paulonga, ‘Mtewela pekesu?’”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ninguwalongela uchakaka, kila mundu mweni kughola sambi ni mhusutu wa sambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mhusutu angulikala ng'ogha kulighuta lya bambu ghaki machuwa hyogha, ila mwana kangulikala ukaya machuwa hyogha. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Hinu Mwana pakawapegha upekesu mtewela pekesu chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ningumanya yiwa mwenga ni waweleka wa ukolu wa Ibulahimu. Hata nagha mngupala kunikoma kwaikiva myajumila ng'ogha mavulo gha nenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nenga ningulongela ghala anilangilili Tati, ila mwenga mngughola ghala awalongilile tati wa mwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Weni wakamyanga, “Twenga twa wana wa Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu akawalongela, “Handa mwenga mngawelili wana wa Ibulahimu, mngalighola handa agholili Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nenga niwalongile uchakaka niuyoghanili kuhuma kwa Sapanga, hata nagha mwenga mngupala kunikoma. Ibulahimu agholili ng'ogha nagha! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />“Mwenga mngughola mighalu hila hila aigholili tati wa mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Weni wakamlongela, “Twenga twa wana wa chakaka wa Sapanga, na tuwela na tati mmonga hela angumanyika Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akawalongela, “Handa Sapanga angaliwela Tati wa mwenga, mnganipala nenga kwaikiva nihuma kwa Sapanga na hinu nabaha. Nihika ng'ogha kwa uweso wa nenga mwenibaha ila wa Sapanga aniyeghili.” <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kwa kyani mngumanya ng'ogha hagha niyalongile? Ni kwaikiva mwenga mngulema kujumila ghala ninguyavula. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Tati wa mwenga ni Lihyukana na mungupala kughola kila angukipala. Mweni awelili mkomawandu kuhuma mtumbulo kangi machuwa hyogha anguhyomela uchakaka kwaikiva kwahela uchakaka mghati ghaki. Hinu kila paailongile uhwangi angulonga kwaikiva kasyovelela uhwangi kangi ni tati wa wahwangi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Nenga ningulonga uchakaka, na ndiwa kwaikiva mwenga mngunijumila ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ghani paghati mwa mwenga anguwesa kuhighilisa yiwa niwela na uhakata kwa Sapanga? Hinu ikiwela ningulonga uchakaka, kwa kyani mngunikwinila ng'ogha? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yula wa Sapanga anguhyoghanila milando gha Sapanga. “Ila mwenga mnguhyoghanila ng'ogha kwaikiva mwenga ng'ogha wandu wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi wakamlongela, “Ghuli, tulongela ng'ogha chakaka yiwa wenga ni Msamalia na kangi uwela na lihoka?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akawayanga, “Nenga nahela lihoka, nenga ningumtundamila Tati ghangu, ila mwenga mngunitundamila ng'ogha.” <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nenga nihakula ng'ogha wandu wanisifili, kuwela na mmonga mweni kupala wandu wanisifili na mweni ndiwa atelamula handa ningughola ghala yangupalwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, “Yula mweni kuukovekela ujumbi wa nenga katu atehova ng'ogha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Hinu, Wayahudi wakalonga, “Hinaa tungumanya uchakaka yiwa wenga uwela na lihoka! Ibulahimu ahovili hilahila na walota wa Sapanga wahovile, wenga ungulongela, ikiwela Mundu kakola lilando lya nenga katu atehova ng'ogha!” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ghuli, ungulighola wenga kwa mkulu nesu kupiti mbuyi wa twenga Ibulahimu yula ahovili? Hata na walota wa Sapanga wahovili. “Unguliwachila wenga kwa ghani?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akawayanga, “Handa panilisifila mwenibaha, kulisifila kwa nenga ni yaghi yaghi. Tati wa nenga mwenga mngulonga yiwa ni Sapanga wa mwenga, ndiwa mweni kunisifila.” <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwenga mungummanya ng'ogha, ila nenga ningummanya. Na nikilonga ningummanya ng'ogha nitewela mhwangi handa mwenga. Nenga ningummanya na ningulikovekela lilando lyaki. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tati wa mwenga Ibulahimu, ahekelelili nesu kumanya yiwa nenga nitehika. “Awelili handa kanilola, ahekelelili nesu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Hinu Wayahudi wakamlongela, “Wenga wambila kutimila machuva ihamsini, iwesakanaghuli kumlola Ibulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ninguwalongela uchakaka, pambila Ibulahimu kaweleka Nenga Niwela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ndiwa wakatola maganga ili wamtovi, ila Yesu akajihigha, kuulongolo akahuka kulighuta lya Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu angalikulola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu pawelili akityanga, akamlola mundu mmonga angalikulola kuhuma uweleka ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Hinu, wavulwa ghaki wakamkonya, “Mvula, ni ghani mweni kughola sambi, mundu hayu au walela ghaki, hata ikamghola kuweleka angalikulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akayanga, “Mundu hayu kawela ng'ogha angali kulola kwaikiva gha sambi zyaki mweni, hilahila kwa sambi zya walela ghaki, ila awelekili angalikulola ili makakala gha Sapanga yawoneki yakighola lihengu mghati mwaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tungupalwa kughola lihengu ghaki yula anilaghilile, ikiwela yambila pamuhi kwaikiva uhiku unguhika lipindi wandu wanguwesa ng'ogha kughola mahengu. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Paniwela nambila kumlimawogha, nenga ni mhana wa mlima wogha.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Badili gha kulonga ghala, akahunya mata pahi akatimbinganya mindakali, akamtyelemeka yula angalikulola kumihu, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Yesu akamlongela, “Uyendi ukalikuwi ku libosi lya Siloamu.” ingumaanisa, “Mweni kuyeghwa.” Hinu akayenda kulikuwa, akahuya akiwela angulola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Hinu, wandu wa pabehi ghaki pamonga na wala wamlolili haku dahile yiwa ni mundu wa kuluwa luwa, wakalonga, “Ghuli, hayu ng'ogha yula kapuku mweni kuwela akitama na kuluwa kuluwa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamonga gha weni wakalonga, “Mweni hina.” Wamonga wakalonga, “Mweni ng'ogha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">ila yula awelekili angalikulola akalonga, “Nenga ndiwa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Hinu wakamkonya, “Hinaa, mihu ghako igubutulikaghuli?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Mweni akawayanga, “Mundu yula wangumkema Yesu katimbinganya mindakali, akanityelemeka kumihu akanilongela, ‘Uyendi kulibosi lya Siloamu ukalikuwi.’ Hinu nikayenda na kulikuwa, nikawesa kulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wakamkonya, “Kakugha mundu hayu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Mweni akalonga, “Nenga nimanya ng'ogha.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wangulolesa kulamiswa kwa yula awelile angalikulola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Hinu wakamyegha hayu mundu awelili angali kulola kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Lichuwa hali Yesu paagholili mindakali na kumgubutula mihu mundu yula, liwelili lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Hinu Mafalisayo wakamkonya mundu yula, “Uwesaghuli kulola?” Akawayanga, “Anityelemikili mindakali kumihu, nenga nikalikuwa na masi hinaa ningulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Hinu wamonga wa Mafalisayo wakalonga, “Mundu hayu kahuma ng'ogha kwa Sapanga, kwaikiva kakola ng'ogha laghililo lya kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Wamonga wakalonga, “Anguwesaghuli mundu mweni sambi kughola kilangihi handa haki?” Kukawela na mlekanu paghati gha weni.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Mafalisayo wakamkonya yula angalikulola kwa liyanja lya ipili, “Wenga ndiwa ulamiswa mihu. Ungumlongelelaghuli mundu hayu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Akalonga, “Mweni ni mlota wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Wakulu wa Wayahudi wakakwinila ng'ogha yiwa mundu yula mweni kulola yiwa mtumbulo awelili angalikulola. Wakawakema walela ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Hinu, wakawakonya wala walela, “Ghuli hayu ndiwa mwana wa mwenga mngulonga awelekili angalikulola? Hinaa kawesaghuli kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Walela ghaki wakayanga, “Tungumanya yiwa hayu ndiwa mwana wa twenga na kangi awelekili angalikulola. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ila twenga tumanya ng'ogha kila kimhumila hata hinaa kangulola, na kangi tungummanya ng'ogha yula kamghola awesi kulola. Mumkonyi mweni baha, mweni kamnung'una ng'ogha, anguwesa kulitetela mweni.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Walela ghaki wailongile nagha, kwaikiva wawatilili wakulu wa Wayahudi, kwaikiva wawelili wajumilana yiwa mundu yoyosi yula ateyitikila yiwa Yesu ni Kilisito atewingwa palighuta lya kuyupila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndiwa kwaikiva walela ghaki wakalonga, “Mweni kamnung'una ng'ogha mumkonyi mweni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Hinu, wakamkema kangi yula mundu awelili angalikulola kwa lihanja lya ivili, wakamlongela, “Ulongeli uchakaka kuulongolo gha Sapanga! Twenga tungumanya yiwa mundu hayu mweni kukulamisa ni mweni sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mweni akayanga, “Ikiwela namweni sambi nenga nimanya ng'ogha. Ila kindu kimonga hela ningumanya, niwelili mundu ningalikulola, na hinaa ningulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Hinu, wakamkonya, “Kakugholela kyani? Kagubutulaghuli mihu ghako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Akawayanga, “Nenga niwalongela kala, mwenga mpala ng'ogha kuyughanila, hinu kwakyani mungupala kuyughanila kangi? Ghuli na mwenga mungupala kuwela wavulwa ghaki?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ila vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakamligha wakilonga, “Wenga ni mvulwa ghaki, twenga ni wavulwa wa Musa.” <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Kangi tungumanya yiwa Sapanga ailongile na Musa, ila yula mundu tummanya ng'ogha kahuma kugha.<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Yula mundu akawayanga, “Hau ni mghalu wa kukangasa. Mwenga mumanya ng'ogha kahuma kugha, ila mweni kanigubutula mihu ghangu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tungumanya yiwa Sapanga anguwahyoghanila ng'ogha wandu weni kumgholela uhakata Sapanga, ila angumhyoghanila mundu yoyosi mweni kumtundamila na kutimilisa mapalo ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kuhuma mtumbulo wa mlima wogha ihyoghanika ng'ogha yiwa mundu kamlamisa mihu mundu angalikulola. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />“Handa mundu hayu kahuma ng'ogha kwa Sapanga, angaliwesa ng'ogha kughola lolose.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Weni wakamyanga, “Wenga uwelekili na kulelwa mahala kwa wandu wenikumgholela Sapanga uhakata, unguwesaghuli kutuvula twenga?” Hinu wakamuwinga kuhuma mulighuta lya kuyupila Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungalikulola kwa mighalu gha kimpumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu akahyoghanila yiwa wamuwinga mundu yula kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi, akayenda kumuhakula. Hinu paamlolili akamkonya, “Ghuli, wenga ungumkwinila Mwana wa Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yula mundu akayanga, “Hayu Mwana wa Mundu ni ghani, ili mbati kumkwinila?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamlongela, “Umlolili kala, na mweni ndiwa hayu mweni kulongela na wenga hinaa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Hinu, yula mundu akalonga, “Ningukukwinila Bambu!” Akamtundamilila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akalonga, “Nenga nihika kumlimawogha hau kulamula wandu, lukani wandu wala walola ng'ogha waloli, na wala weni kuliwachila yiwa wangulola wakotoho kulola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Wamonga wa Mafalisayo wawelili pamonga na mweni pawahyoghanila hagha, wakamlongela, “Ghuli, twenga hilahila ni wangalikulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akawalongela, “Handa mngaliwela wangalikulola mngawela ng'ogha na uhakata kwa Sapanga, ila hinaa mngulonga, ‘Twenga tungulola,’ hai ingulangiha mmbila mumgholela uhakata Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mhungaji maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Ninguwalongela uchakaka, yoyosi yula yayingila ng'ogha kulihungulu lya kondolu kwa kupitila ndatilo, ila anguyingila kwa njila ghangi hayu kamwihi na mpokola. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ila mweni kuyingila kupitila ndatilo hayu ndiwa muhungaji wa kondolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mgholokela wa lihungulu angumuwoposelela ndatilo mhungaji hayu wa kondolu na kondolu wanguhyoghanila liloi lyaki, mweni anguwakema kondolu ghaki kila monga kwa lihina lyaki na kuwalongosa panji. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Pakawahumisa panji anguwalongola kuulongolo, na weni kondolu wangumkovekela, kwaikiva wangulimanya lilowi lyaki. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ila kondolu hagha wawesa ng'ogha kumkovikela mhenja na kangi watetula mbilo kwaikiva walimanya ng'ogha lilowi lyaki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu awalongilile mlandano hau, ila weni wawesa ng'ogha kumanya kila apalili kuwalongela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni mhungaji wa maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela kangi, “Ninguwalongela uchakaka, nenga ndiwa ndatilo gha kondolu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wala waghangi wogha walongolili kuhika pambila gha nenga ni wawihi na wapokola, na kondolu wawayoghanila ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nenga ni handa ndatilo, hinu mundu yeyosi ateyingila kupitila kwa nenga atelokoka, na hayu atepata kila angukipala. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwihi anguhika kwa lukani lwa kuhija, kukoma na kuyaghamisa. Ila nenga nihika mpati kuwela na ukomu, kangi waweli nau kwa utangala.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Nenga ndiwa mhungaji wa maha. Mhungaji wa maha angujumila kuhova kwaikiva gha kondolu ghaki.” <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mundu mweni kughola lihengu lya kuhunga kondolu ili apati mapesa, na kondolu hagha hindu ghaki ng'ogha pakalola ghalumwitu anguhika, hayu anguwaleka kondolu na kutula mbilu, na hinu ghalumwitu anguwakamula na waghangi wangulekanila. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mweni angutula mbilu kwaikiva mweni angulola mapesa weka na ng'ogha kondolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nenga ni mhungaji maha. Ninguwamanya wala wa nenga, na wenikuwela wa nenga wangunimanya nenga, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />handa vila Tati angunimanya, hilahila na nenga ningummanya Tati. Nenga ningujumila kuhova ili kondolu wakotoho kuyaghamika. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kangi niwela na kondolu waghangi, wenikuwela ng'ogha wa lihungulu hali. Ingunipala niwakunguli na weni hilahila, na weni watelihyoghanila lilowi lya nenga, hinu patewela na lipinga limonga na mhungaji mmonga.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Tati wa nenga angunipala kwaikiva ningulihumisa nihovi ili nipati kuwela mkomu kangi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kwahela mundu angumboka ukomu ghangu, ila nenga ninguuhumisa kwa kupala mwenibaha. “Nenga niwela na uweso wa kuhumisa, na uweso wa kuutola kangi, havi ndiwa Tati kanilongela nigholi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Pawahyoghanila milando hila kukahumila kangi na mlekano paghati gha Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Watangala gha weni wakalonga, “Kana lihoka hayu, kangi kana lukwale! Kwa kyani tumyoghanili?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ghangi wakalonga, “Hagha ng'ogha milando gha mundu mweni lihoka. Ghuli, lihoka anguwesa kumghola angalikulola aloli?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulemwa na Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Haku Yelusalemu kuwelili na mhambu wa kukumbwiki kuwoposolwa Lighuta lya Sapanga. Iwelili lipindi lya lupepu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu akawela angutyanga mu Lighuta lya Sapanga kulyugha lya Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Hinu, Wayahudi wakamtindila, wakamlongela “Tungupala kumanya yiwa wenga kwa ghani? Handa wenga ndiwa kilisito, utulongeli lipalapala.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akayanga, “Niwalongilili, ila mwenga mkwinilili ng'ogha. Mahengu ninguyaghola kwa uwesa wa lihina lya Tati ghangu yangunihighilisa nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ila mwenga mungukwinila ng'ogha kwaikiva mwenga ng'ogha kondolu wa nenga. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Kundolu wa nenga wangulihyoghanila lilowi lyangu, nenga ninguwamanya, na weni wangunikovikela. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nenga ninguwapegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na weni wateyaghamila ng'ogha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na kwahela mundu atewesa kuwahumisa mumawoku ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tati wa nenga anipeghili kondolu hagha ni mkulu kupiti wogha na kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kuwapokola kuhuma kumawoku gha Tati wa nenga. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />“Nenga na Tati twa mmonga.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Hinu, Wayahudi wakatola maganga ili wamtovi na yeni ili wamkomi. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu akawalongela, “Niwalangiha mahengu matangala kuhuma kwa Tati. Kindu liki paghati gha havi kinguwaghola mnitovi maganga?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi wakamyanga, “Tungukutova wenga maganga ng'ogha kwaikiva gha mahengu maha, ila kwaikiva gha kumlighu Sapanga ungujighola wenga kwa Sapanga na ikiwela wenga kwa mundu hela handa wandu waghangi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akayanga, “Ghuli, iyandikwa ng'ogha kumayandiku gha laghililo gha mwenga, mwenga ni milungu?” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ikiwela Sapanga kawakema milungu wala wahikilwa na lilando lya Sapanga, na twenga tungumanya yiwa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga chakaka machuwa hyogha, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ghuli mnguwesaghuli kumlongela yula Tati kamhaghula na kumyegha kumlimawogha angulighu, ghuli ni kwaikiva nilongile yiwa nenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ikiva ningughola ng'ogha mahengu gha Tati ghangu mkotoho kunikwinila. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ila ikiwela ningughola mahengu gha Tati ghangu, pamonga na yiwa mungunikwinila ng'ogha, hinu mkwinili hagha mahengu ghangu. Kwa nagha mtemanya yiwa Tati kamghati gha nenga na nenga na mghati gha mweni.<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ndiwa Wayahudi wakayesa kangi kumkamula, ila akachulubuka mumawoku ghao.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akayenda kangi kumwambu gha lweni Joludani, akayenda mbaka kula Yohana paawelili akibatisa akalikala pala. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wandu watangala wakamyendela, wakalonga, “Yohana kaghola ng'ogha mkangaso wowosi. Ila mighalu hyogha awelili kamlongelelela hayu mundu ni chakaka.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Wandu watangala wala wawelili pala wakamkwinila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kihu kya Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Pawelili mundu mmonga lihina lyaki Lazalu, hayu awelili mvina. Mundu hayu awelili akilikala ku Betania pamonga na Malia na Malita wahacha ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia hayu ndiwa yula awelili kampakala Bambu mahuta gha kunungila na kumpyangula maghulu kwa hwila ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Hinu, wala wahacha ghaki Lazalu wakalaghila ujumbi kwa Yesu wakilonga, “Bambu, ghanja ghako ni mvina.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu pakahyoghanila nagha, akalonga, “Uvina hau utemkoma ng'ogha, ila uteghola wandu wamuyinuli Sapanga, na kwa kupitila hali Mwana wa Sapanga hilahila ateyinulwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu awapalili nesu Malita na walongo ghaki Malia pamonga na Lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Hata badili gha kuhyoghanila yiwa Lazalu ni mvina, Yesu akayendelela kulikala pala pala mahala awelili kwa machuwa maivili kuulongolo. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Badili gha machuwa maivili kuyenda akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Tuyendi kangi ku Yudasia.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wala wavulwa wakamlongela, “Mvula lipindi mayaghani hela lipiti Wayahudi wapalili kukutova kwa maganga, wenga ungupala kuyenda haku kangi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akayanga, “Ghuli, pamuhi kuwela ng'ogha na masaa ikumi na ivili? Hinu, mundu paatyanga pamuhi kawesa ng'ogha kulikwala kwaikiva angulola lijuwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ila mundu paatyanga uhiku atelikwala kwaikiva mhana uwela ng'ogha mghati ghaki.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu pakayomola kulonga milando hila, akawalongela, “Ghanja wa twenga Lazalu kaghonja, ila nenga ninguyenda kumuyimusa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Hinu wala wavulwa wakamlongela, “Bambu ikiwela kaghonja lughonu hayu atelama.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Weni waliwachilili yiwa Yesu ailongile kughonja handa kughonja lughono, ila mweni ailongilile kihu kya Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela lipalalipala yiwa, “Lazalu kahova, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ila ninguhekelela kwaikiva niwelili ng'ogha haku lipindi Lazalo akikolwa na kihu, ili mpati kukwinila, hinu tuyendi kula angulikala.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yula mweni kukemwa mavila akawalongela wavulwa wayaki, “Handa ni kuhova tuyendi na twenga tukahovi pamonga na mvula.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiwa anguwahindula wandu na kuwapegha ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu paahikili ku Besania akalola limambi, liwela kavikwa Lazalo mghati ghaki ipiti machuwa manjechi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kimbwani kya Besania kiwelili pabehi na Yelusalemu, utali wa kilomita itatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wayahudi watangala wahikili kuwataya moyu Malita na Malia kwa kuhwegha mhaja ghao.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Hinu, Malita pakahyoghanila yiwa Yesu anguhika, akayenda kumpokela ila Malia ahighalili ukaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita akamlongela Yesu, “Bambu, handa ungaliwela haku, mlongu ghangu angalihova ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ila ningumanya yiwa hata hinaa chochosi utekiyupa kwa Sapanga, atekupegha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu akamlongela,“Mlongu ghako atehinduka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita akamyanga, “Ningumanya yiwa atehinduka lipindi lya wandu kuhindulwa, lichuwa lya kumwihu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamlongela,“Nenga ndiwa mweni kuwahindula wandu na kuwapegha ukomu. Yula mweni kunikwinila nenga hata ikawela anguhova, atelama, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na Mundu yeyosi mweni ukomu na kunikwinila nenga, katu atehova ng'ogha. Ghuli, ungukwinila hagha?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita akamlongela, “Hina Bambu! Nenga ningukwinila yiwa wenga ndiwa kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga, yula atehika kumlimawogha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulila masosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Badili gha kulonga hagha, Malita akayenda kumkema malia, mhacha ghaki, akamlongela wakiwela weka ghao, “Mvula kabaha, angukukema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia pakahyoghanila nagha, akayimuka kwa uloposelo, akamyendela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu awelili akali mnjila kayingila kukimbwani, awelili mahala palapala Malita paampokelili. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Hinu, Wayahudi wala welili ukaya pamonga na Malia wakimtaya moyu, pawamlolili kayimuka na kuyenda panji, wakamkovikela. Wakiliwachila yiwa awelili anguyenda kumambi kuililila kula.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Hinu, Malia pakahika mahala pala Yesu awelili, akamtundamilila manung'una kuulongolo gha maghulu ghaki akamlongela, “Bambu, handa ungaliwela baha, mlongu ghangu angalihova ng'ogha!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu paamlolile Malia akilila na wala Wayahudi wanguhika pamonga na mweni wangulila hilahila, Yesu akawela na lusungu pamonga na kunyengemala nesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Hinu akawakonya, “Mumsika kogha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">wakamlongela, “Bambu, tuyendi ukaloli.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akalila masosi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Hinu, Wayahudi wakalonga, “Mloli vila awelili kampala.”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ila amonga wakalonga, “Ghuli, hayu ng'ogha yula amuhumbulili mihu yula angalikulola, hinaa kasindwa kumghola Lazalu akotoho kuhwegha?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumhindula Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Hinu Yesu akiwela na luhungu kumoyu, akayenda kumambi. Limambi lyeni liwelili mbaku na ligubikwa kwa liganga likulunga. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akalonga, “Mlihumisi hali liganga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Malita mweni kuwela mlongu ghaki yula mweni kuhova akalonga, “Ila Bambu, lipindi hali atewela angununga kwavila wamuwika kala kulimambi machuwa manjechi yapiti.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ghuli, nikulongelili ng'ogha yiwa paukwinila, uteulola ukulu wa Sapanga?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Hinu, wakalihusia lila liganga. Yesu akalola kunani kundumba, akalonga “Ningukushukwile Tati kwaikiva wenga unguniyughanila mayupu ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ningumanya yiwa unguniyughanila machuwa hyogha. Ila ningulonga hagha kwaikiva wandu hagha wa bahapa wapati kukwinila yiwa wenga ndiwa mweni kunilaghila.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Pakayomola kulonga hagha, Yesu akakema kwa lilowi likulunga, “Lazalu! Uhumi panji!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Yula awelili kahova akahuma panji, kunu kumaghulu kabindililwa nguu mbuleti gha kusikila mbaka kuwusu. Yesu akawalongela, “Mumwoposoli mumleki ayendi zyaki.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wanguhakula njila kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Hinu, Wayahudi watangala paghati gha wala wahikili kwa malia pawalolili mghalu hula augholile Yesu, wakamkwinila. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ila amonga gha weni wakayenda kwa Mafalisayo na kuwalongela mighalu hyogha hila aigholili Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Hinu kuulongolo ghaki watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo wakawakema vilongosi wa njengakaya ngulu gha Wayahudi, wakalonga, “Tumgholi kyani? Mundu hayu angughola makangaso yatangala nesu. <figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mtambika wa Kiyahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Patumleka ayendeleli nagha wandu wogha watemkwinila, na hinu wandu wa kuhuma ku Loma watehika kukolonganya lighuta lya Sapanga lyetu na mlima watwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Mmonga paghati gha weni, wamkema lihina lyaki Kayafa, yula awelili mtambika mkulu lichuva lila akawalongela, “Mwenga mmanya ng'ogha kindu chochosi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />“Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha yiwa ni mbaha mundu mmonga ahweghi kwaikiva gha wandu wogha, kupiti wandu wogha wa mlima hau wayalamiki?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayafa ailongile ng'ogha milando hai kwa mawachilo ghaki mweni. Ila kwaikiva awelile Mtambika Mkulu lichuva lila, awelili akilota yiwa Yesu atehova kwaikiva gha mlima wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Kangi kuhova kwa mweni, ng'ogha kwaikiva gha mlima wa Wayahudi weka, ila awakunguli pamonga wana wa Sapanga wapaganyikili.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Hinu, kuhuma lichuwa lila wakulu wa Wayahudi wakahakula njila gha kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, Yesu akawela kangutyanga ng'ogha lipala lipala ku Yudasia, ila akahuka pala, akayenda mahala pabehi na luvagha, kummbwani waukema Efulaimu. Akalikala haku pamonga na wavulwa ghaki.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Mhambu wa Wayahudi wa Pasaka uwelili pabehi, na wandu watangala wayendili ku Yelusalemu ili waliyandali kujumilika kuulongolo gha Sapanga pambila gha mhambu hau. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Hinu, wakawela wangumuhakula Yesu, pawalikungula ku Lighuta lya Sapanga, wakakonyana, “Ghuli, mnguliwachila mundu hayu atewesa ng'ogha kuhika kumhambu hau?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo walaghilili yiwa mundu pakamanya mahala pala kawela Yesu awalongeli ili weni wapati kumkamula.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliamu angumyitila Yesu mahuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliku 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Machuwa isita pambila gha muhambu wa pasaka, Yesu ahikili Besania kula awelili angulikala Lazalu yula mweni kuhindulwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Haku wamyandalilili mulyo wa lumihi, na Malita akawela angumyandalila Yesu. Na mweni Lazalu awelili mmonga paghati gha wala weni kukemwa kulyegha pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Hinu, Malia akatola mandina gha supa yenikuvikwa mahuta gha kunungila yenikugholwa kwa libiki lya nalido, akampakala Yesu mumaghulu na kupyata kwa hwila ghaki. Lighuta lyogha likanungila manungilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Hinu, Yudasi Isikaliyoti mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili yula atemhyuka Yesu kuulongolo, akalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Tungaliwusa mahuta hagha na kupokela mapesa na kuwapegha wakapuku, kwaikiva tungaliwesa kupokela mapesa gha kumuhipa mundu mahipo gha lichuva limonga?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yudasi alongili vila ng'ogha kwaikiva awawonelili luhungu wala wandu kapuku, ila kwaikiva mweni awelilili mwihi. Hayu ndiwa mweni kukola mhaku wa mapesa, mihanja wekaweka mweni anguwela angutola kuhuma mula.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Hinu Yesu akamuyanga Yudasi, “Mkotoho kumghasa hayu nyongo, hayu kaniyitila hagha mahuta gha kunungila kwaikiva gha lichuwa lya kusikwa nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kwaikiva wandu kapuku muwela nau machuwa hyogha, ila mtewela ng'ogha na nenga machuwa hyogha bila mwihu."<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa watambika wanguhakula njila gha kumkoma Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi watangala wakahyoghanila yiwa Yesu kawela ku Besania. Hinu, wakayenda haku lukani lwau luwelili ng'ogha kumlola Yesu weka, ila hilahila kumlola Lazalu yula awelili kahindulwa na Yesu kuhuma kukihu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Hinu watambika wakulu wakahakula njila gha kumkoma Lazalu hilahila, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwaikiva Yesu amuhindulile Lazalo, watangala wa Wayahudi wawahyukile wakamuyendela Yesu na kumkwinila.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyingila Yelusalemu kunu wandu wakikuwa vilulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Kilau ghaki lipinga likulunga lya wandu wenikuhika kweni mhambu wakayoghanila yiwa Yesu kamnjila anguhika ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Hinu, wakatola miputila gha mibiki gha mipangalala, wakahuma wakayenda kumpokela, kunu wakitova lilowi wakilonga, “Ayinuliwi Sapanga! Ahighilwi hayu mweni kuhika kwa lihina lya Bambu. Ahighilwe nkosi wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu apatile mwanapunda mmonga, akakwela kunani ghaki handa yalongili mayandiko,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mkotoho kutila, mwenga wandu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">uloli nkosi wa mwenga anguhika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">kakwela mwanapunda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Wavulwa ghaki haku mtumbulo wamanyili ng'ogha mighalu hila, ila Yesu pakahindulwa kala, ndiwa wakakumbwiki yiwa awelili kayandikilwa hagha, na hinu wandu wawela wamgholela hagha.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lipinga lya wandu wala wawelili pamonga na Yesu lipindi pamkemili Lazalu kuhuma kulimambi, na kumuhindula, wayendelelili kulongelelela ghala yahumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />lipinga lya wandu likayenda kumpokela Yesu kwaikiva wawelili wayoghanila yiwa awelili kaghola mkangasu hau wa kumuhindula Lazalu. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Hinu Mafalisayo wakalongilana weni kwa weni, “Mngulola hinaa tuwesa ng'ogha kughola chochosi kangi. Uloli wandu wogha wangumkovekela mweni!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamonga wa Wagiliki wangupala kumlola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kumhambu hau wa Pasaka haku Yelusalemu hilahila Wagiliki wayendili kumyupa Sapanga, <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />hagha wamuyendelili Filipo, mwenikaya wa ku Betisaida kumlima wa Galilaya, wakamlongela, “Mkulu, tungupala kumlola Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo akayenda, akamlongela Andelea, hinu wogha waivili wakayenda wakamlongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu akayanga, “Lipindi lya kuyinuliwa kwa Mwana wa Mundu lihika kala!” <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, mbunji gha nganu paikulilwa ng'ogha mulutupi inguhighala mbunji hela. Ila paikullilwa mulutupi hai itemela na kumwihu itelela mbunji zitangala. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mundu yeyosi mweni kupala ngalilu ghaki ateiyalamisa, na yula mweni kuhyomela ngalilu ghaki gha mlima wogha hau, ateulokola hata ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mundu yoyosi mweni kupala kunitumikila angupalwa anikovikeli, ili aweli na nenga kokosi ninguyenda. Mundu yoyosi mweni kunitumikila Tati ghangu atempegha utundamilu.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukilongelela kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Hinaa mpumulo ghangu ungunyengemala nesu. Na nimanya ng'ogha nilongi niki. Ghuli, nilongi, ‘Tati ninguluwa unilokoli kuhuma kulipindi lya mahakilo hagha?’ Ng'ogha, niwesa ng'ogha kuluwa nagha kwaikiva nihika kumlimawogha ili nipitili lisaa hali lya mahakilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tati, uliyinuli lihina lyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ndiwa likahuma lilowi kuhuma kundumba, “Niliyinula kala na kangi niteliyinula.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Hinu lipinga lya wandu lyeni kuwela pala palihyoghanila lila lilowi, amonga gha weni waliwachilili mlindimu wa ladi, na amonga waliwachilili yiwa Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kalonga na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Lilowi hali kuhuma kwa Sapanga lihika ng'ogha kwaikiva gha nenga, ila ni kwaikiva gha mwenga. uma kwa Sapanga na lihika kwaikiva gha mwenga ng'ogha nenga. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Hinaa ndiwa lipindi lya mlima wogha hau kulamulwa, hinaa mkulu wa mlima wogha hau atedangwa panji. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ila nenga paniyinulwa kunani gha mlima, nitewakwegha wandu wogha wahiki kwa nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu ailongile hagha akilangiha yiwa atehova kwa kihu kya ndambu liki.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Hinu, lipinga lila likayanga, “Twenga tungulongelwa kulaghililo lya twenga yiwa Kilisito atelikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Hinu kwa kyani unguwesa kulongela yiwa Mwana wa Mundu angupalwa kuyinulwa kunani? Na hayu Mwana wa Mundu kaghani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mhana ukali kuwela pamonga na mwenga kwa lipindi mayaghani. Hinu mtyangi kumhana hau kwaikiva mmbila kuwela nau, mkotoho kukolwa na lwisa, kwaikiva yula mweni kutyanga mlwisa kamanya ng'ogha kula anguyenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Hinu pamuwela na hau mhana muukwinili ili mpati kuwela wandu wa mhana hau.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Wandu walema kumkwinila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Badili gha kulongela hagha, Yesu akahuka na kujihigha kutali na weni. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hata badili gha Yesu kughola makangasu ghala hyogha kuulongolu ghao, weni walemili kumkwinila, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />ili lipati kutimila lila lilando lya Mlota wa Sapanga Isaya paalongili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Bambu ni ghani mweni kukwinila ujumbi wa twenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na ni kwa ghani Bambu kawonesa makakala ghaki?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kwa nagha wawesa ng'ogha kumkwinila, kwaikiva Isaya ailongile kangi.<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Sapanga kadosola mihu ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na kawaghola waweli watatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ili mihu ghao ikotoho kuwesa kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na malangu ghao yakotoho kuwesa kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wakotoho kunihyukila, ili mbati kuwalamisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">angulonga Bambu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Mlota Isaya alongile hagha kwaikiva ailolile kwa utali ukulu wa Yesu, hinu akalongela habali zyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Pamonga na hagha wandu watangala paghati gha wakulu wa Wayahudi wamkwinilili Yesu. Ila kwaikiva gha kuwatila Mafalisayo wakalema kumjumila lipalalipala kwa kutila kuwingwa kuyenda kuyupa kulighuta lya kukonganikila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Vilongosi hagha wa Wayahudi wapalili nesu kutundamilwa na wandu kupiti kutundamilwa na Sapanga.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kahika kulokola wandu wa mlima wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Mundu yula mweni kunikwinila, kangwinila ng'ogha nenga hela, ila angumkwinila hilahila Tati mweni kuniyegha. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yoyosi mweni kunilola nenga, kamlola yula mweni kunilaghila. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nenga nihika handa mhana kumlimawogha hau, ili wandu wogha weni kunikwinila wakotoho highala mlwisa. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yula mweni kuhyoghanila milando ghangu na akaleka kukovekela kila nilongili, nitemtosa ng'ogha, kwaikiva nenga nihika ng'ogha kuutosa mlima wogha hau ila nihika kuulokola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ila wogha weni kunilema na kuulema ujumbi wa nenga watetoswa kulichuwa lya mwihu kwa milando gha chakaka niilongile. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nenga nilongile ng'ogha kwa kupala mwenibaha. Ila niilongela ghala angupala Tati yula mweni kunilaghila kanilongela nilongi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nenga ningumanya lilaghilo lyaki yiwa linguyegha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Ndiwa kwaikiva nilonga ghala Tati kanilaghila nilongeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwakuwa maghulu wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Hinu, iwelili pambila gha lichuwa lya mhambu wa Pasaka. Yesu amanyili yiwa lisaa lyaki lya kuhuka kumlimawogha na kuhuya kwa Tati ghaki litimila kala. Mweni awelili akiwapala wandu ghaki wala weni kuwela kumlimawogha, kangi awapalile nesu bila mwihu.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki pawawelili wakilyegha mulyo wa lumihi. Lihyukana awelili kamlulunganya kala Yudasi mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti yiwa amhyuki Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu aimanyile yiwa Tati kampegha ukulu wa kulongosa vindu vyogha na kangi yiwa ahumile kwa Sapanga na yiwa atehuya kangi kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Hinu, Yesu akahuka kuhuma mmesa pala pawawelili wakilyegha, akavika mmbali nguu ghaki gha panje, akatola kitambala akajiwopa kukibulibulilo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Hinu akavika masi mundeleko, akatumbula kuwakuwa maghulu wavulwa ghaki na kuwapyata kwa kila kitambala ajiwopili. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Pakahika kwa Simoni Petelo, Petelo akamkonya, “Bambu, ghuli wenga ungupala kunikuwa nenga maghulu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akamyanga, “Utewesa ng'ogha kumanya hinaa, kila ningukighola ila haku kuulongolo utemanya.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petelo akamlongela, “Nenga ngana kukuliwa maghulu na wenga” Yesu akamyanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">“Nenga panileka kukukuwa wenga maghulu, wenga utewela ng'ogha pamonga na nenga katu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petelo akamyanga, “Bambu, paikawela nagha, ukotoho nikuwa maghulu weka yaki, ila unikuwi na mawoku pamonga na mutu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamlongela Petelo yiwa, “Yula mweni kuyogha kala kapalwa ng'ogha kuyogha kangi, ila angupalwa kukuwa maghulu ghaki weka, kwaikiva mhigha ghaki wogha wambuleti. Na mwenga mwa mbuleti ila ng'ogha wogha.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu ailongile nagha kwaikiva ammanyili kala yula atehika kumhyuka ndiwa kwaikiva akalongela, “Mmonga paghati gha mwenga kana ndaka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Pakayomola kuwakuwa maghulu na kuvala kangi lihabiti lyaki, akatama pamesa, akawalongela, “Ghuli, mmanya kila niwagholela?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwenga mngunikema nenga Mvula wa mwenga na Bambu. Ni chakaka pamlonga nagha, kwaikiva nenga ni mweni. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Hinu, ikiva Mvula na Bambu wa mwenga ninguwakuwa maghulu, inguwapala na mwenga kukuwilana mwenga kwa mwenga maghulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nenga niwapegha mlandano hau, ili na mwenga mpati kugholelana handa vila niwagholela mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ninguwalongela chakaka yiwa, mtumikila kamkulu ng'ogha kupiti bambu ghaki, hilahila yula mweni kulaghilwa kamkulu ng'ogha kupiti yula mweni kumlaghila. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Handa mumanya hagha, hinu mtehighilwa pamuyaghola.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Hagha nilongela nilonga ng'ogha kwa mwenga wogha, ninguwamanya wala niwahaghulili. Ila ni ingupalwa nesu yatimili Mayandiko gha Sapanga, yula mweni kuwela ghanja ghangu na kalyegha mulyo pamonga na nenga kangalambukila.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nenga ninguwalongela mighalu hai pambila gha lolosi lila kuhumila, ili mpati kukwinila yiwa Nenga ndiwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, “Mweni kumpokela yula nimlaghila kambokela nenga, na yula mweni kumbokela nenga kanipokela yula mweni kunilaghila nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongelela vila atehyukwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayu 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliku 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Badili gha kulonga hagha, Yesu akawela kaghasika nesu mmoyu hinu akalongela lipalalipala, “Mmonga paghati mwa mwenga atenihyuka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wavulwa wakalolesana, kwaikiva wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa ghani Yesu angumlongelela. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mmonga wa wavulwa ghaki, mweni kuwela kapalwa nesu na Yesu awelili kasaghamila makombi gha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petelo akalangila liwoko kwa mvulwa yula na kulongela, “Umkonyi angumlongelela ghani milando hai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Hinu yula mvulwa akamkonya Yesu kwa upabehi, “Bambu, ungumlongelela ghani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akayanga, “Yula nitempegha haki kipandi kya libumunda nikichwikili mkimbundi ndiwa hayu.” Hinu akatola kipandi kya libumunda akakichwika mkimbundi, akampegha Yudasi mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yudasi pakapokela kipandi kila, Lihyukana likamyingila. Hinu Yesu akamlongela, “Kila ungupala kughola ugholi kwa kuloposela.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ila kwahela hata mmonga paghati mwa wala wawelili pala mmesa kawesa kumanya yiwa liki kamlongela. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwaikiva Yudasi awelili muwika mapesa, amonga wa weni wakaliwachila yiwa awelilili kamlongela ahemeli vindu vyeni kupalwa lichuwa lila lya mhambu, au awelili kamlongela akawapeghi chochosi wandu kapuku.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Hinu, Yudasi paatolili kila kipandi kya libumunda, akahuma panji lipindi lilalila. Na hai iwelili uhiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghilo lyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Badili gha Yudasi kuhuka, Yesu akalonga, “Hinaa ukulu wa Mwana wa Mundu unguyenda kuwoneka lipalalipala na kangi ukulu wa Sapanga utewoneka kupitila mweni.” <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Mwana atewalangiha wandu vila Sapanga kawela mkulu, hilahila Sapanga atewalangiha wandu vila Mwana kawela mkulu, Sapanga ateghola hali njenji nesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wana wanenga, nitewela na mwenga kwa lipindi mayaghani hela. Mwenga mtenihakula, ila hinaa ninguwalongela kila niwalongelili vilongosi wa Wayahudi yiwa, “Kula ninguyenda mwenga mtewesa ng'ogha kuhika!” <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ninguwapegha lilaghilo lyonu. Mpalani mwenga kwa mwenga. Handa vila nenga niwapala mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />“Pampalana mwenga kwa mwenga wandu wogha watelimanya yiwa mwenga ni wavulwa wa nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga yiwa Petelo atemkanila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petelo akamkonya, “Bambu, unguyenda kugha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu akamyanga, “kula ninguyenda utewesa ng'ogha kunikovekela hinaa, ila utenikovekela kuulongolo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petelo akamkonya, “Bambu, kwa kyani nisindwi kukukovikela hinaa? Nenga niliyandala kuhova kwaikiva gha wenga.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu akayanga, “Ghuli, chakaka uliyandala kala kuhova kwaikiva gha nengaa? Chakaka ningukulongela, pambila gha njogholu kutova lilowi utenikanila mihanja itatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiwa njila gha kuyenda kwa Tati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mkotoho kunyengemala. Mngumkwinila Sapanga, munikwinili na nenga hilahila.” <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ukaya kwa Tati wa nenga kuwela na fyumba fitangala. Handa ingawelili ng'ogha nagha, ningaliwalongela kala, hinaa ninguyenda kuwayandalila mahala. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na paniteyenda na kuyandala mahala kwaikiva gha mwenga, nitehuya na kuwatola, ili na mwenga muwesi kuwela pala niwela nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />“Mwenga munguimanya njila gha haku ninguyenda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi akamkonya, “Bambu, twenga tumanya ng'ogha kula unguyenda, hinu tutemanyaghuli hai njila?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akamyanga, “Nenga ndiwa njila na chakaka na ukomu. Kwahela mweni kuwesa kuyenda kwa Tati ila kwa kupitila nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ikiwela mngunimanya nenga, mngummanya na Tati hilahila. Na kutumbula hinaa mngummanya na kangi mumlola kala.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipu akamlongela, “Bambu, utulangihi Tati hai itetubaka.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamyanga, “Filipu nilikala na mwenga lipindi lyogha hali, na wenga Filipu uwesa ng'ogha kunimanya nenga? Yula kunilola nenga kamlola kala Tati. Hinu kwa kyani ungunikonya, ‘niwalangihi Tati?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ghuli, wenga ukwinila ng'ogha yiwa nenga namghati gha Tati, na mweni Tati kamghati gha nenga? Hai milando ningulongela ningulonga ng'ogha handa ningupala nenga, ila Tati angughola lihengu mghati mwa nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mngupalwa kunikwinila panilonga nenga namghati mwa Tati na Tati kamghati mwa nenga. Handa ng'ogha nagha hinu mukwinili ghala mahengu ninguyaghola. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, yula mweni kunikwinila nenga ateghola mighalu hila ninguighola nenga, na ateghola hata makulu nesu, kwaikiva nenga ninguyenda kwa Tati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Pamyupa chochosi kwa lihina lyangu, hali nitelighola, ili Mwana amyegheli Tati utundamilu. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Handa mteniyupa chochosi ku uwesa wa nenga niteghola.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga atewayeghela Mpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Handa chakaka mngunipala mkoli malaghilu ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nenga nitemyupa Tati awayegheli Mpumulo wa Sapanga na hayu atewela pamonga na mwenga machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Mpumulo hayu atewagubutilila wandu uchakaka. Wandu weni kumkanila Sapanga wanguwesa ng'ogha kumpokela Mpumulo hayu, kwaikiva wangumlola ng'ogha, kangi wangummanya ng'ogha. Ila mwenga mngummanya Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwaikiva angulikala pamonga na mwenga, kangi atewela mghati mwa mwenga.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Panitehuka, nitewaleka ng'ogha weka yenu, nitehika kangi kwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Lyambila lipindi mayaghani hela wandu wa mlima wogha hau watenilola ng'ogha kangi, ila mwenga mtenilola na kwaikiva ningulama, na mwenga hilahila mtelama. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Lichuwa lila palihika mtemanya yiwa nenga niwela mghati mwa Tati, na mwenga mwamghati mwa nenga, hilahila nenga mghati mwa mwenga.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Mundu yula mweni kupokela na kukola malaghililo ghangu, hayu ndiwa angunipala na hayu mwenikunipala nenga Tati ghangu atempala mundu hayu na nenga nitemghola animanyi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Hinu Yudasi, ila ng'ogha Yudasi Isikalioti akakonya, “Bambu inguwesekanaghuli utugholi twenga tukumanyi na ng'ogha wandu wa mlima wogha wakumanyi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akamyanga, “Mundu yeyosi mweni kunipala atelikovikela lilando lyangu na Tati ghangu atempala, nenga na Tati tutehika kwa mweni na kulikala na mweni.” <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ila wala wogha weni kunipala ng'ogha watekola ng'ogha kila niwalongilile, na milando nilongilile yanguhuma ng'ogha kwa nenga, ila yahumilili kwa Tati aniyeghili.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Niwalongela milando hai nikiwela nambila pamonga na mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ila Mpumulo wa Sapanga, yula Tati atemlaghila kwa mwenga kulihina lya nenga, ndiwa hayu atewavula na kuwakumbusa hyogha ghala niwelili niwalongela.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Ninguwalekela kuponga kweni kuyeghwa na nenga, kulikala kwa kuponga haku ninguwapegha ng'ogha handa kula mlima wogha unguwapegha. Mkotoho kunyengemala kangi wala mkotoho kutila chochosi.” <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mnihyoghanilili nikilonga, “Ninguyenda, ila nitehuya kangi kwa mwenga.” Handa munganipala mungahekelela kwa vila ninguyenda kwa Tati, kwaikiva Tati wa nenga ni mkulu kupiti nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nenga niwalongela mighalu hai hinaa, pambila gha kuhumila chochosi, ili payahumila mpati kukwinila. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nitelonga ng'ogha na mwenga mighalu itangala, kwaikiva yula mhakata mweni kulongosa mlima wogha hau anguhika, mweni kahela makakala kupiti nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ningughola hagha hyogha handa Tati vila anilaghilile kughola, ili wandu wa mlima wogha wamanyi yiwa ningumpala Tati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Hinaa mgholoki ili tuyendi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni msabibu wa chakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Nenga ni handa msabibu wa chakaka, na Tati wa nenga ni mtukutula.” <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kila liputila mghati ghangu lyeni kulema kulela matungula mweni angulihumisa na kila liputila lyeni kulela angulipungulila lipati kulela nesu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwenga muhululika kala kwaikiva mkwinila mavulo ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Muyendileli kulikala mghati gha nenga, na nenga niteyendelela kulikala mghati gha mwenga. Handa vila miputila inguwesa ng'ogha kulela matungula weka ghaki bila kutama kumsabibu, hinu muwesa ng'ogha kughola ghala anguyapala Sapanga bila kulikala mghati gha nenga.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nenga ni msabibu, mwenga ni miputila. Mweni kulikala mghati mwa nenga, na nenga paniwela mghati mwa mweni, hayu ateghola mighalu mitangala gha kumhekelesa Sapanga, kwaikiva pamleka kulikala na nenga mtelepelela kughola chochosi.” <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ikiwela mundu kaleka kulikala mghati mwa nenga, hayu ni handa liputila lyeni kudangwa na kuyuma na wandu wangulikungula na kulinyanya lyoto na kuyalamika. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Handa pamkala mghati mwa nenga na milando ghangu ikakala mghati mwa mwenga, hinu myupi Tati chochosi kila mngukipala na mweni atewapegha. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Hinu wandu watemanya vila Tati ghangu kawela mkulu, kwa mwenga kughola ghala anguyapala Sapanga na mtewela wavulwa ghangu chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Handa Tati vila angunipala nenga na nenga hilahila niwapala mwenga, mlikali kwa kulongoswa na upalo ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Pamkola malaghilo ghangu mtelikala kuupalo ghangu, handa vila nenga nikola malaghilo gha Tati ghangu na kulikala kuupalo ghaki.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Hagha niwalongela ili luheku lwa nenga lutami mghati mwa mwenga na liheku lwa mwenga lipati kuwela likulunga nesu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Laghililo ninguwalaghila ni hali mpalani mwenga kwa mwenga handa vila nenga ninguwapala mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Njila ngulu kulangiha yiwa unguwapala waghanja ghako ni kuhova kwaikiva gha weni. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Hinu mwenga ni waghanja wa nenga pamteghola yala ninguwalaghila. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Kwa nagha nenga niwakema ng'ogha mwenga wahusutu ghangu, kwaikiva mtumikila kamanya ng'ogha kila angukighola bambu ghaki. Ila nenga ninguwakema mwenga waghanja kwaikiva niwamanyisa hyogha yala Tati kanilongela nenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mwenga mnihaghula ng'ogha, ila nenga niwahaghula na kuwayegha myendi kuwaghola waghangi wanikwinili, na wandu hagha wayendileli machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Na chochosi mkiluwa kwa lihina lya nenga Tati apati kuwapegha. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Hinu, ninguwalaghila kila mundu na ampali myaki.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wa kumlimawogha wanguwahekelelela ng'ogha wakwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Ikiwela wandu wa mlima wogha wanguwahekelelela ng'ogha mwenga, mkumbuki yiwa watumbulili kuleka kunihekelela nenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Handa mwenga mngaliwela wandu wa mlima wogha hau, mlima wogha hau ungaliwapala handa wandu ghaki. Mwenga ng'ogha wa mlima wogha kwaikiva nenga niwahaghula kuhuma kumlimawogha, ndiwa kwaikiva mlima wogha unguleka kuwahekelelela. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mkumbwiki yala niwalongelili yiwa, “Mtumikila kamkulu ng'ogha kupiti bambu ghaki.” Ikiva wanihakili nenga, watewahakila na mwenga hilahila, na ikiva walikola lilando lyangu, watelikola na lilando lya mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ila hagha hyogha watewagholela mwenga kwaikiva mnikovekela nenga, kwaikiva wammanya ng'ogha yula mweni kunilaghila. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ingaliwela nileka kuhika na kulongela na weni, wangaliwela ng'ogha na sambi, ila hinaa wanguwesa ng'ogha kulitetela yiwa wawela ng'ogha na sambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yula mweni kunihekelelela ng'ogha nenga hayu atemhekelelela ng'ogha na Tati ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Handa wangalilola ng'ogha mighalu niigholile yeni kuwesa ng'ogha kugholwa na mundu ghangi, wangaliwela ng'ogha na kunihekelela ng'ogha ila hinaa wayalola niyagholile weni wangulema kutuhekelelela nenga na Tati ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ila hali lihumila lukani kutimila lila lilando kulaghililo lya Musa lyeni kulongela, “Waleka kunihekelelela yaghi.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Nitemyegha Mpumulo kuhuma kwa Tati na mweni atewalangiha kila kya uchakaka. Mpumulo hayu atewatanga na kuwalongela uchakaka weni kunongelela nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Kangi na mwenga mtenilongelela kwa wandu kwaikiva niwelili na mwenga kuhuma mtumbulo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Milando hai niwalongela lukani mkotoho kuleka kunikwinila.” <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wandu watewavinga mwenga kumaghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi. Kangi lipindi linguhika itewela mundu pakawakoma mwenga ateliwachila yiwa kwa kughola nagha angumtumikila Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Watewagholela mighalu hai hyogha kwaikiva wammanya ng'ogha Tati, wala wangunimanya ng'ogha na nenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Hinu, ninguyalongela hagha kwa mwenga hinaa, ili payahumila mpati kukumbwike yiwa nilongili kala.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Mahengu gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Niwalongelili ng'ogha mighalu hai kuhuma mtumbulo kwaikiva niwelili pamonga na mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Hinu, hinaa nenga ninguyenda kwa yula mweni kuniyegha, ila kwahela hata mmonga wa mwenga mweni kunikonya, Unguyenda kogha? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Hai ni kwaikiva niwalongela mighalu hai, hinu mioyu gha mwenga inyengemala hinaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ila ninguwalongela uchakaka, ni mbaha nenga nihuki, kwaikiva handa nitehuka ng'ogha hayu mweni kuwatanga atehika ng'ogha, ila paniyenda nitemlaghila kwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Hayu pakahika atewalangiha wandu wa mlima wogha hau yiwa wangukosela kwa mighalu gha sambi, kuwalangiha haki, pamonga na utoso wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Kangi hayu Mpumulo atewalangiha yiwa sambi ghao ni kukosela kwa kuleka kunikwinila nenga, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />mweni atewalangiha yala yeni kumhekelesa Sapanga, kwaikiva nenga ninguyenda kwa Tati, na mwenga mtenilola ng'ogha kangi. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Atewela anguwalangiha paluagha habali gha utoso, kwaikiva yula mhakata mweni kulongosa mlima wogha hau katoswa kala.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Niwela na milando mitangala gha kuwalongela, ila hinaa muwela ng'ogha na uweso wa kumanya hyogha.” <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ila pakahika hayu Mpumulo wa uchakaka atewalongosa kumanya uchakaka wogha, kwaikiva mweni atelonga ng'ogha milando ghaki mwenibaha, ila atelongela kila angukihyoghanila, na ndiwa atewalongela, hilahila atewamanyisa kila kitehumila haku kuulongolo. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Mweni atewaghola mnitundamili kwa kutola ujumbi wa nenga na kuwalongela mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vyogha kawela navyu Tati ni vya nenga, ndiwa kwaikiva niwalongela yiwa hayu Mpumulo atewamanyisa mwenga yala yeni kuhuma kwa nenga.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyengemalu na luheku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola ng'ogha, na kangi lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Hinu wamonga wa wavulwa ghaki wakakonyana, “Angumanisa niki paangulonga, ‘Lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola ng'ogha, na kangi lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola?’ Kwaikiva ninguyenda kwa Tati!” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Hinu wakayendelela kukonyana, “Angumanisa liki” hayu paailonga, lihighala lipindi mayaghani? “Tumanya ng'ogha angulonga liki.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu amanyili yiwa wangupala kumkonya, hinu akawalongela, “Ghuli, mngukonyana kwa yala nilongile yiwa, lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola ng'ogha, na kangi lihighala lipindi mayaghani mtenilola kangi?” <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ninguwalongela uchakaka, mwenga mtelila na kulumbilila, ila mlima wogha utehekelela, mwenga mtenyengemala, ila unyengemalu wa mwenga uteghalambuka kuwela kiheku. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Lipindi mdala anguliwopola angunyengemala kwaikiva lipindi lya lusungu lihika kala. Ila pakayomola kuliwopola anguisemwa ghala hyogha yamnyengemisili, kwa luheku lwa kupokela mwana. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Hilahila na mwenga hinaa muwela na unyengemalo hau, ila nenga nitehika kangi, na mwenga mtehekelela na luheku hali kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kuwahumisilila kuhekelelela kwa mwenga.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Lichuwa hali palihika mteniluwa ng'ogha nenga chochosi handa mngughola hinaa. Chakaka ninguwalongela, chochosi mtemluwa Tati kwa lihina lya nenga atewapegha.” <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpaka hinaa mluwa ng'ogha kindu chochosi kwa lihina lyangu. Mluwi na mwenga mtepokela lukani muweli mnguhekelela nesu.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kausinda mlima wogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Niwalongela mighalu hai kwa kifisu. Ila litehika lipindi nitelonga ng'ogha kwa kifisu kangi, ila nitewalongela lipala lipala yala yeni kumlongelela Tati.” <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Lichuwa hali mtemluwa Tati kwa uwesa wa nenga. Nitewayupila ng'ogha kwa Tati, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwaikiva Sapanga mwenibaha anguwapala mwenga, kwaikiva mwenga mnipala nenga na mjumila yiwa nihuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nenga nihuma kwa Tati, nihika kumlimawogha hau na hinaa “Ninguyenda kwa Tati.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ndiwa wavulwa ghaki wakalonga, “Hina, hinaa ungulonga lipala lipala ungulonga ng'ogha kwa kufisa.” <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Hinaa tungumanya yiwa wenga ungumanya mighalu hyogha, “Na kwa hinu kwahela kya kukukonya kangi chochosi, hinu tungukwinila yiwa unguhuma kwa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, hinaa mngukwinila?” <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Lipindi linguhika na kangi lihika kala, mwenga wogha mtepaghalanyika kila mundu ukaya kwaki na nenga mtenileka wekayangu, ila nenga waweka ng'ogha kwaikiva Tati kapamonga na nenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Hagha niwalongela lukani mlikali kwa kuponga kwa kukonginika na nenga, mumlimawogha utewaghola mghasiki, ila mlitutumuli! “Nenga niusinda mlima wogha.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwaluwila wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu pakayomola kulonga yala kwa wavulwa ghaki, akalola kunani kundumba, akatumbula kuyupa, “Tati, lila lipindi lihika kala! Uwalangihi wandu ukulu wa Mwana ghako ili na Mweni apati kukutundamilisa.” <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwaikiva umpeghili uwesa wa kuwalongosa wandu wogha, ili niwapeghi wandu wogha ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Hau ndiwa ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, yiwa wakumanyi wenga ni Sapanga wa chakaka wa weka na kummanya Yesu Kilisito yula umyeghili. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nenga nikutundamilisa kumlimawogha hau kwa kutimilisa lila lihengu unipeghili niligholi. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Hinaa, Tati, unipeghi ukulu hula niwelili nau pambila gha mlima wogha hau kulumbwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nighola umanyikani na wandu unipeghili kumlimawogha hau. Weni wawelili wa wenga ukanipegha nenga na lilando lyako waliyitikila.” <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Hinaa wangumanya yiwa vyogha unipeghili vihuma kwa wenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Milando hila unipeghili niwapegha weni, na weni waipokela na kukwinila yiwa chakaka nihuma kwa wenga, hilahila wangukwinila yiwa wenga ndiwa unilaghila.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Nenga ninguwayupila weni, niuyupila ng'ogha mlima wogha, ila ninguwayupila wala unipeghili, kwaikiva ni wawenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Wogha wenikuwela wa nenga ni wa wenga na wogha wenikuwela wa wenga ni wa nenga, na ukulu ghangu uwoneka kupitila weni. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Hinaa nenga ninguhika kwa wenga Tati, ninguuleka mlima wogha hau ila weni wahamu, hinu Tati ninguyupa uwagholokeli kwa makakala gha lihina lyako unipeghili ili waweli kindu kimonga handa nenga na wenga vila tuwela wamonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Paniwelili na weni, nenga niwagholokela, kwa uwesa ghako unipeghili. Nenga niwagholokela, hata ikawela kwahela mmonga mweni kuyaghamika, ila yula mweni kupalwa ayaghamili na kughola Mayandiko gha Sapanga yatimili. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Hinu, hinaa ninguhika kwa wenga na ningulonga mighalu hai nikiwela nambila kumlimawogha hau, ili wawesi kuwela na luheku handa vila nenga ninguhekelela. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nenga niwapeghili lilando lyako, ila wandu wa mlima wogha wakawahekelelela ng'ogha, kwaikiva hagha weni kukukwinila, ng'ogha wandu wa mlima wogha hau, handa nenga vila niwela ng'ogha wa mlima wogha. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nenga ninguluwa ng'ogha uwahumisi kumlimawogha ila uwagholokeli ili wakotoho kusindwa na yula mhakata. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Weni ng'ogha wa mlima wogha hau, handa vila nenga niwela ng'ogha wa mlima wogha hau. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ningukuluwa uwagholi kuwela wandu ghako chakaka, kuuchakaka ghako, kwaikiva lilando lyako ndiwa chakaka. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Wenga unilaghilili nenga kumlimawogha hau, na nenga hilahila ninguwalaghila weni kumlimawogha, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />na kwaikiva gha weni nenga mwenibaha ningulihumisa kukutumikila, ili na weni walihumisi kukutumikila kwa uchakaka.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ninguwaluwila ng'ogha hagha wavulwa weka yau, ila ninguwayupila hilahila na wala wogha watenikwinila kupitila lila wateyughanila kuhuma kwa hagha wavulwa.” <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ninguyupa hagha wogha waweli kindu kimonga. Tati ningukuyupa hagha wogha waweli mghati mwa twenga handa wenga vila uwela mghati gha nenga na nenga mghati gha wenga. Ninguluwa waweli kindu kimonga ili wandu wa mlima wogha upati kumanya yiwa wenga ndiwa unilaghilili. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Ukulu hula unipeghili na nenga niwapegha weni, ili waweli kindu kimonga handa twenga vila tuwela mmonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nenga niweli mghati mwa weni na wenga mghati gha nenga, ninguluwa watimiliswi waweli watimila kwa kuwela kindu kumonga, ili mlima wogha upati kumanya yiwa wenga ndiwa unilaghilili, na unguwapala weni handa ungunipala nenga.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tati ningupala wala unipeghili waweli pamonga na nenga kokosi niwela, ili wawesi kulola hula ukulu unipeghili kwaikiva unipalili pambila gha kulumbwa mlima wogha.” <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tati wa Mmaha mlima wogha ungukumanya ng'ogha, ila nenga ningukumanya. Hagha na weni wangumanya yiwa wenga ndiwa unilaghilile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />“Nighola umanyikani kwa weni na niteyendelela kughola nagha, ili upalo uwela nau kwa nenga uweli mghati mwa weni na nenga niweli mghati mwa weni.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu pakayomola kuyupa, akayenda kumwambu gha kilweni kya Kediloni, pamonga na wavulwa ghaki. Mahala pala pawelili na kitawa, hinu Yesu akayingila mula pamonga na wavulwa ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yula Yudasi, mweni kumhyuka Yesu, amanyili mahala pala kwaikiva mihanja itangala Yesu akonganili na wavulwa ghaki haku. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Hinu, Yudasi akayenda kutola lipinga lya watovangondu na wagholokela kuhuma kwa watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo, wakahika na mweni kukitawa wakiwela na limbamba na miyengi na migoha. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu akimanya yala hyogha yatemhumila, akajihumisa kuulongolo ghao akawakonya, “Ni ghani mngumhakula?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Weni wakamyanga, “Ni Yesu wa Nazaleti,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu akawayanga, “Nenga ndiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yudasi mwenikumhyuka awelili kagholoka pala pamonga na weni. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Hinu Yesu pakalongela, “Nenga ndiwa,” weni wakahuya kuhyetu, wakaguwa pahi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu akawakonya kangi, “Mungumhaka ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Weni wakalonga, “Yesu Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akawalongela, “Nenga niwalongela kala yiwa ni nenga, hinu ikiwela mngunihakula nenga muwaleki hagha wandu wayendi zyau.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Alongile vila lukani yahumili yala alongili, “Wala unipeghili nimyaghamisa ng'ogha hata mmonga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petelo awelili na lipanga, hinu, akalihomola, akamdumula lipulikilo lya mbandi gha kuliyila mtumikila wa Mtambika Mkulu. Mtumikila hayu akemilwi Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela Petelo, “Uhuyisi lipanga mumhaku ghaki. Ghuli, ungumanya ng'ogha yiwa ningupalwa nihakilwi handa vila Tati ailamulile yiwa nihakilwi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kwa Mtambika Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Hinu lila lipinga lya watovangondu wa Loma na mkulu ghao pamonga na wala wagholokela wa wakulu wa Wayahudi wakamkamula Yesu na kumuwopa. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Hinu wakamyegha huti kwa Anasi, mkwahanu wa Kayafa. Kayafa awelili Mtambika Mkulu wa lipindi lila. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Hayu Kayafa ndiwa yula haku kuhyetu awelili kawalongela Wayahudi yiwa mbaha mundu mmonga ahovi kwaikiva gha wandu wogha.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angumkanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayu 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliku 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petelo pamonga na mvulwa ghangi wakamkovekela Yesu. Hayu mvulwa mghangi awelili akimanyikana na Mtambika Mkulu, hinu akayingila pamonga na Yesu kulyugha lya lighuta lya Mtambika Mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ila Petelo agholokili panji pabehi na mlyango, hinu yula mvulwa mghangi mweni kuwela akimanyikana kwa Mtambika Mkulu akahuma panji na kulongela na mhinja muwopola mlyango, na mhinja hatu kamlekesela Petelo ayingili mghati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yula mhinja akamkonya Petelo “Ghuli, wenga kwa mmonga wa wavulwa wa mundu hayu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petelo akayanga “Nenga ng'ogha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Lichuwa lila kuwelili na lupepu hinu watumikila pamonga na wagholokela wawelili wakiyota lyoto, na Petelo akajichotika paghati na weni wakitindila lyoto lila.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika Mkulu angumkonya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliku 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Hinu Mtambika Mkulu akamkonya Yesu mighalu gha wavulwa ghaki na mavulo ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akayanga, “Nenga nilongela lipalalipala machuwa hyogha kunu wandu wakiwela wanguniyughanila. Niwelile nikivula kumaghuta gha kukonganikila Wayahudi pamonga na kulighuta lya Sapanga haku ni mahala wangukonganika Wayahudi wogha na nilongile ng'ogha kwa kifisu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Hinu, kwa kyani ungunikonya nenga? “Wakonyi wala wenikuniyoghanila niki niwalongile. Weni wangumanya kila niwalongela.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Pakayomola kulonga ghala mgholokela mmonga mweni kuwela kagholoka pala akamtova kuwuso, kunu akikonya, “Ghuli, kwa kyani ungumyanga Mtambika Mkulu nagha?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamyanga, “Handa nilongile lya uhakata, ulangihi uhakata hau, ila handa nilongile uchakaka kwa kyani ungunitova?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hinu Anasi akamyegha Yesu akiwela kawopwa kwa Mtambika Mkulu Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angukanila Yesu kangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayu 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliku 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Lipindi lila Simoni Petelo akiwela pala anguyota lyoto, wamonga wa wala wawelili pala wakamkonya, “Ghuli, wenga ng'ogha mmonga gha wavulwa ghaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Petelo akakanila “Nenga ng'ogha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mmonga wa wala watumikila wa Mtambika Mkulu, mlongu ghaki yula mundu mweni kudumulwa lipulukilo na Petelo, akamkonya, “Ghuli, nenga nikuwonili ng'ogha kula kukitawa mkiwela pamonga na mweni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petelo akakanila kangi liyanja lingi, “Ng'ogha nenga” Na njogholu akalila.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11">11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliku 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Hinu malawila pee, wakamtola Yesu kuhuma kwa Kayafa, wakamyegha kulighuta lya kilongosi wa Waloma. Ila weni wayingila ng'ogha mghati gha lighuta lyaki, kwaikiva watili kuyingila kutewaghola wajumilwi ng'ogha kukumyupa Sapanga na hinu wakasindwa kulyegha mhambu wa Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Hinu kilongosi wa Waloma mwenikukemwa Pilatu akawayendela panji, akalonga, “Ni mahakata ghani mundu hayu kaghola mbaka mumyeghi kwa nenga?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Weni wakayanga “Handa hayu angaliwela ng'ogha na mahakata tungalimyegha ng'ogha kwa wenga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Hinu Pilatu akawalongela, “Hinu, mumtoli mwenga, mkamtosi kwa kukovekelana na malaghilo lya mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wayahudi wakamlongela. “Twenga malaghililo gha twenga yangutulemesa kukoma mundu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Wala wandu walongile nagha ili lila lilando alongile Yesu kulangiha ni kihu kyani atehova lipati kuwoneka.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Kwa nagha Pilatu akayingila kangi mghati akamkema Yesu, na kumkonya, “Wenga ndiwa Nkosi wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akayanga, “Ghuli, milando hai ungulongela ni ghako mweni au uyoghanila kwa wandu waghangi habali zyangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu akayanga, “Ghuli, unguliwachila nenga ni Myahudi? Wandu wa kumlima ghako na watambika ndiwa weni kukuyegha kwa nenga. Ghuli wenga ughola liki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akamyanga “Unkosi wa nenga ng'ogha wa mlima wogha hau. Handa unkosi wa nenga ungawela wa mlima wogha hau watumikila ghangu wangalinitovanila ili nikotoho kukamulwa na Wayahudi. Ila unkosi ghangu ng'ogha wa mlima wogha hau.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Hinu Pilatu akamkonya, “Ghuli, wenga kwa Nkosi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu akayanga, “Wenga ulongila yiwa nenga na Nkosi. Nenga niwelekwa kwaikiva gha lihengu hali, na kwaikiva gha nagha nihika kumlimawogha niwalongeli wandu chakaka na kila mmonga mweni kukwinila uchakaka hayu angunihyoghanila.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu akamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli, uchakaka ni niki?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu angulamulwa kuhova</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayu 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliku 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Badili gha kulonga ghala Pilatu akayenda panji kangi akawalongela wala vilongosi wa Wayahudi, “Nenga nilola ng'ogha lilando lya kumtosa mundu hayu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ila musyovelela kuniluwa niwawoposeleli muwopwa mmonga lipindi lya mhambu wa Pasaka. Ghuli, hinaa mngupala niwawoposeleli Nkosi wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Weni wakatova lilowi wakilonga, “Ng'ogha mundu hayu, tungupala utuwoposeleli Balaba!” Balaba awelili mpokola.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Hinu, Pilatu akamuhumisa Yesu na kuwalongela watovangondo wamtovi hyatu gha ngosi. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Watovangondu wakapota likokoma lya mihomi, wakamvika kumutu ghaki, na kumvalisa lihabiti lya sambalau, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />wakawela wanguhika kuulongolu ghaki na kulonga, “Jambu Bambo, wenga Nkosi wa Wayahudi!” Kunu wangumtova kuwuso ghaki.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu akahuma panji kangi, akalilongela lila lipinga lya wandu weni kulikungula pala, “Mloli, ningumyegha mundu hayu kwa mwenga ili mpati kumanya yiwa nenga nilola ng'ogha uhakata kwa mundu hayu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Hinu Yesu wakamuhumisa panji wakiwela kavwala likokoma lya mihomi na lihabiti lya sambalau. Pilatu akawalongela, “Mumloli! Mundu mweni ni hayu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Watambika wakulu na wagholokela pawamlola wakatova lilowi. “Umvambi kulipingika! Umvambi kulipingika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilatu akawalongela, “Mumtoli mwa weni, mkamvambi kulipingika, kwaikiva nenga baha nilola ng'ogha uhakata ghaki.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi wakamuyanga, “Twenga tuwela na laghililo lya Musa na kukovekelana na lilaghilo hali, angupalwa ahovi kwaikiva alikemili yiwa mweni ni Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu pakahyoghanila milando hila, hinu akatila nesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Pilato akayingila kangi mghati gha lighuta ghaki akamkonya Yesu, “Wenga unguhuma kugha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Ila Yesu kamyanga ng'ogha lolosi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilatu akamlongela, “Ghuli, kwakyani unguniyanga ng'ogha? Ungumanya ng'ogha yiwa nenga niwela na uweso wa kukulekesela au kukuvamba kulipingika?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu akamyanga, “Wenga uwela na uwesa kunani gha nenga nikwaikiva upeghwa na Sapanga, ila yila mweni kuniyegha haku kaghola hindu ihakata nesu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Hinu Pilatu pakahyoghanila ghala akawela anguhakula njila gha kumlekesela, ila Wayahudi wakawela wangutova lilowi, “Handa ungumuwoposela mundu hayu hinu wenga utewela ng'ogha ghanja wa nkosi wa Waloma mwenikukemwa Kaisali. Mundu yoyosi mwenikujighola yiwa kankosi angumngingama Kaisali.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilatu pakahyoghanila milando hila akamyegha Yesu panji, akatama kukikalilu kya utoso, pala penikukemwa, “Payandaswa maganga” au kwa kiebulaniya “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Lichuwa lila liwelili lichuwa lya mayandalilo gha mhambu wa Pasaka. Hinu paihika isaa isita pamuhi. Pilato akawalongela Wayahudi, “Hayu baha Nkosi wa mwenga!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Weni wakatova lilowi likulunga, “Umkomi! Umkomi! Mumvambi”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilatu akawakonya, “Ghuli, nimvambi Nkosi wa mwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Watambika wakulu wakayanga, “Twenga tuwela ng'ogha na nkosi ghangi ila Nkosi mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Hinu, Pilatu akawapegha Yesu ili wamvambi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu anguvambwa kulipingika</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Hinu wakamtola Yesu . <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu akahuma akiwela kapapa lipingika lyaki mbaka kumahala wangupakema, “Lifufu lya mutu.” Kwa kiebulaniya wangukema Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Pakahika mahala pala wakamvamba kulipingika, hilahila pala wawavambili wandu waghangi waivili, mmonga na lipingika ghaki mbandi gha liwoku lya kuliyila na mghangi liwoku lya shotu na Yesu akawela paghati ghao. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu akayandika litangaso na kulaghila livikwi kunani gha lipingika lya Yesu liyandikilwi, “Yesu wa Nazaleti, Nkosi wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Hinu kwaikiva pala pawelili pabehi na mmbwani wa Yelusalemu Wayahudi watangala wakawesa kusoma litangaso lila, kwaikiva litangaso lila liwelili liyandikwa kwa luga gha Kiebulania, Kilatini na Kigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Watambika wakulu wakamlongela Pilatu, “Ukotoho kuyandika, ‘Nkosi wa Wayahudi,’ ila uyandiki ‘Yula mweni kulikema Nkosi wa Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu akayanga, “Kila niyandika kitehighala handa kiwela.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Watovangondo pawayomola kumvamba Yesu, wakatola nguu zyaki, wakazilekanisa kumapinga manjechi, lipinga limonga kwa kila mtovangondo, wakatola hilahila na lihabiti ghaki, lihabiti hali liwelili lifumilwi na kuwela kindu kimonga kuhuma kunani mbaka pahi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Hinu, wala watovangondo wakalongilana, “Tukotoho kuibalula, ila tuihinisili gudugudu ili tumanyi yiwa litewela lya ghani.” Mghalu hau ugholekili ili mayandiko yatimili yala yalongili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wapeghanili nguu zya nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na lihabiti lya nenga wakalihinisila gudugudu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Hinu ndiwa wagholili wala watovangondo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pabehi na lipingika lya Yesu wawelili wagholoka nyongu ghaki, na nyongu mnung'una wa Yesu, Malia mdala wa Kileopa na Malia kuhuma Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu pamwonili nyongo ghaki mahala pala pamonga na yula mvulwa ampalili wagholoka pabehi, akamlongela nyongo ghaki, “Nyongu, uloli, hayu ndiwa mwana ghako.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Hinu akamlongela yula mvulwa, “Uloli, hayu ndiwa nyongu ghako.” Na kuhumila lipindi lila yula mvulwa akamtola nyongo ghaki Yesu akayenda nayu ukaya ghaki.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhwega</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hinu Yesu akamanya yiwa kayomola mahengu ghaki gha kuwahumisa wandu kuhuma mlwisa na kuwayegha kumhana akalonga, “Ninguyumilila.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Pala pawelili na kyombu kimema divai ikalipa yeni kusasa. Hinu wakavika lidodoki mula mudivai, wakalitumbika mulidengi na kumvikila Yesu kumlomu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu pakayomola kuyesa hila divai akalonga, “Itimila kala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Hinu, akayinamisa mutu, akahova.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhomwa mgoha mulubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kwaikiva iwelili lichuwa lya kuyandala lichuwa lya kupumulila, Wayahudi wapalile ng'ogha mihigha ihighali pala palipingika kulichuwa lya kupumulila kwaikiva lichuwa hali ni likulunga nesu kwa Wayahudi. Hinu wakamluwa Pilatu maghulu gha wandu wala wavambilwi yavetulwi na mihigha ghao ihumiswi kuhuma mulipingika. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Kwa nagha watovangondo wakayenda wakavetulwa maghulu gha mundu wa mtumbula na yula wa ivili wenikuwela wavambwa pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ila pawamyendili Yesu wamwonili kahova kala kwa nagha wamtenyula ng'ogha maghulu ghaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Ila mtovangondo mmonga kampoyola mulubafu kwa mgoha, na bwitu ikahuma mwahi na masi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mundu alolili mighalu hila igholekili pala ndiwa mweni kulongelela mghalu hula, angumanya yiwa ghala ayalongile ni chakaka, na mweni angulongela ili na mwenga hilahila mpati kukwinila. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mighalu hai igholekili lukani Mayandiko gha Sapanga yapati kutimila, “Kwahela hata mhupa mmonga utevetuka.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kangi kuwela na mayandiko maghangi yenikuyandikwa, “Watemlola yula wampoyolili kwa mgoha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angusikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Badili gha hagha, Yusufu, mwenikaya wa Alimatayu, amluwili Pilatu atoli higha wa Yesu. Yusufu awelili mvulwa wa Yesu, ila kwaikiva awatilile watambika wa Wayahudi. Hinu, Pilatu akampegha, nagha Yusufu akayenda kutola mhigha wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemu, yula mwenikuwela lipindi litenu amyendelili Yesu uhiku, akahika akiyegha mhanganyu wa manimani na manungilu, yatangala gha kilo iselasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Hinu, wandu hagha waivili wautolili mhigha wa Yesu, wakaubindilila nguu mbuleti gha kusikila pamonga na kuupakala yala manungilu. Handa wasyovelela Wayahudi kukusika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Na pala paavambiliwi Yesu pawelile na kitawa na kukitawa kila kuwelile na limambi lya hyonu lisikwa ng'ogha mundu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Hinu, wakamsika Yesu kulimambi lila kwaikiva liwelili pabehi na Wayahudi wawelili wakiliyandala na lichuwa lya kupumulila.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kahinduka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliku 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Malawila pee lipindi kukali na lwisa kulichuwa lya ijumapili, Malia yula anguhuma ku Magidala akayenda kulimambi akalola lila liganga lihumiswa na kuvikwa mmbali mwa mlyango wa limambi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Hinu hayu akayenda kwa kutula mbilo mbaka kwa Simoni Petelo na kwa yula mvulwa ghangi mwenikuwela apalilwi nesu na Yesu, akawalongela, “Bambu kahumiswa kulimambi na twenga tumanya ng'ogha wamyegha kugha.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petelo na yula mvulwa ghangi wakahuya kuyenda kulimambi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Hinu wogha wakatula mbilo ila yula mvulwa ghangi akamlongola Petelo na kuhika njenji. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Pakaghondama ili aloli mghati, akalola hila nguu mbuleti gha kusikila ila kayingila ng'ogha mghati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Kuhyetu ghaki akakovekela Simoni Petelo, akayingila mula mlimambi akalola hila nguu mbuleti, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />pamonga na kila kitambala wamwopili Yesu kumutu. Kila kitambala kivikwa ng'ogha pabei na nguu mbuleti gha kusikila, ila kiwelili kibindwa na kuvikwa kumahala weka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Hinu yula mvulwa ghangi mweni kulongola kuhika kulimambi, akayingila hilahila mghati akalola na akajumila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kwa lipindi lila Petelo pamonga na wavulwa waghangi wawelili wambila kumanya ghala mayandiko yailongile, ingupalwa ahinduki. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Hinu wala wavulwa wakahuya ukaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumhumila Malia wa ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayu 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliku 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ila Malia akahighala akigholoka panji gha limambi akilila. Paawelili angulila, akagondama, kusyungulila mula mlimambi, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akawalola watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga waivili wenikuvala nguu mbulete na kugholoka pala mhigha wa Yesu pauwelili uvikwa mmonga akiva kagholoka mbandi gha kumutu na ghangi kagholoka mbandi gha kumaghulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Wala watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wakamkonya “Nyongo, ungulilila niki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Mweni akawalongela, “Wahumisa higha gha Bambu ghangu, nenga manya ng'ogha kula wayenda kuuvika.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Badili gha kulonga hagha, akaghalambuka kuhyetu, akamlola Yesu kagholoka pala, ila mweni kammanya ng'ogha yiwa ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamkonya, “Nyongo, ungulilila niki? Ungumhakula ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Malia kunu akiwachila yiwa yula kamgholokela wa kitawa kila akamlongela, “Bambu, handa utolile mhigha ghaki nongeli umvika kugha nenga nikautoli.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Hinu Yesu akamkema, “Malia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Mweni Malia akaghalambuka na kumlongela kwa kiebulania, “Raboni!” akimaanisa “Mvula”.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ukotoho kungola, kwaikiva nambila kuyenda kunani kwa Tati ila uyendi kwa walongu ghangu ukawalongeli, nenga ninguyenda kunani kwa Tati wa nenga na hayu ni Tati wa mwenga, Sapanga wa nenga na Sapanga wa mwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Hinu Malia akayenda kuwalongela wavulwa yiwa kamlola Bambu, hinu akawalongela hyogha yala Yesu amlongile.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Lumihi lwa ijumapili wavulwa wawelili walikungula kulighuta limonga na kutata milyango kwaikiva wawelili wanguwatila vilongosi wa Wayahudi. Bwitu Yesu akawagholokela paghati ghao, akawajambusa, “Kuponga na kuweli na mwenga”. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Pakahyomola kulonga ghala, akawalangiha mawoku ghaki na lubafu lwaki. Hinu wala wavulwa wakahekelela nesu kumlola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela kangi, “Kuponga na kuweli na mwenga, ninguwalaghila mwenga handa vila Tati anilaghilili nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Pakayomola kulonga ghala, akawapulililila mbumulilo akalonga, “Mpokeli Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Pamuwalekesela wandu sambi syau Sapanga atewalekesela sambi syau, na wala wogha muwalekesela ng'ogha Sapanga atewalekesela ng'ogha sambi syau.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumhumila Tomaso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomaso, mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili, mwenikukemwa mvila, awelili ng'ogha pamonga na wavulwa wayaki lipindi Yesu pahikili. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Hinu wavulwa waghangi wakamlongela, “Tumwonili Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomaso akawalongela, “Nenga panilola ng'ogha likovu lya misumali mumawoku ghaki, na kutaya kyala kulikovu lya mlubafu, nitejumila ng'ogha.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Hinu badili gha machuwa inane, wavulwa ghaki wakiva mghati gha lighuta kangi na kunu Tomasi akiwela hamu pamonga na weni. Milyango ikiwela itatwa, ila Yesu akahika akagholoka paghati gha weni akalonga, “Kuponga na kuweli na mwenga!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Hinu akamlongela Tomaso, “Uyeghi kyala kyaku, uloli mawoku ghangu, uyeghi na liwoku lyako uyavisi mulubafu lya nenga, ukotoho kuwela na holu wenga ukwinili hela.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomaso akayanga, “Wenga ni Bambu ghangu na kangi wenga ni Sapanga ghangu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ghuli, wenga ungukwinila kwaikiva unilola? Mbaha wala wanilola ng'ogha, ila wangunikwinila.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa hitabu haki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu agholile kuulongolu gha wavulwa ghaki makangasu ghangi matangala yenikuwela yayandikwa ng'ogha kuhitabu haki. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ila hagha yayandikwa ili muwesi kukwinila yiwa Yesu ndiwa kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga na kwa kumkwinila mpati kuwela na ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wavulwa isaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Badili gha ghala, Yesu awahumili kangi wavulwa ghaki mmbali gha lihiwa lya Tibelia na lyeni lingumanyika lihiwa Galilaya. kawahumila kwa njila hai, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petelo, Tomaso mweni kukemwa mvila na Natanaeli mwenikaya wa kana gha ku Galilaya, na wana waivili wa Zebedayo na wavulwa ghaki waghangi waivili wawelili pamonga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petelo akawalongela wayaki, “Nenga ninguyenda kulopola homba.” Weni wakamlongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">“Natwenga tutekovekelana na wenga,” hinu wakayenda, wakakwela whatu, ila uhiku hula wapatili ng'ogha chochosi. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Malawila pakutumbula kulangala, Yesu agholokili mmbali gha lihiwa, ila wavulwa wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa kamweni. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Hinu Yesu akawakonya, “Waghanja mpata ng'ogha homba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Wakayanga tupata ng'ogha.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mtaghi nyafu upandi wa kuliyila wa whatu na mwenga mtepata homba.” Hinu, wakatagha nyafu ila hinaa wakasindwa kukwegha nyafu kwaikiva gha homba vila wamema mnyafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Yula mvulwa mweni kupalwa nesu na Yesu akamlongela Petelo, “Hayu ni Bambu!” Simoni Petelo pakahyoghanila ghala, akajiwopa nguu ghaki kwaikiva awelili kavika mmbali nguu ghaki lipindi angughola lihengu, hinu akajumbila mmasi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ila wavulwa waghangi wakawela wakihika mmbali mwa lihiwa kwa whatu kunu wakikwegha wafu weni kumema homba. Na weni wawelili ng'ogha kutali na njengani, ila iwachililwa utali wa mita imia imonga. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Hinu pawahika kunjengani wakalola makala gha lyoto na kunani gha lyoto lila kuwelili na homba pamonga na libumunda vikinyanywa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akawalongela, “Myeghi kunu amonga gha homba muwalopola.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petelo akakwela muwhatu na kukwegha hula wafu mpaka njengani na hula wafu uwelili umema homba wakulu imia imonga na ihamsini na itatu, ila pamonga na wala homba kuwela watangala, hula wafu ulakatula ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mhiki mlyeghi mulyo.” Ila kwahela hata mvula mmonga paghati gha weni kayesa kumkonya yiwa, “Ghuli, wenga kwa ghani?” kwaikiva wamanyili kala yiwa ka Bambu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu akahika, kutola lila libumunda, akawametulila kila mmonga kipandi kyaki, na akaghola vilavila kuwala homba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Hai ikawela lihanja lya itatu Yesu kuwahumila wavulwa ghaki badili gha kuhinduka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga na Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pawayomola kulyegha, Yesu akamkonya Simoni Petelo, “Ghuli, Simoni mwana wa Yohanawenga ungunipala nenga kupiti hagha?” Na mweni akayanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">“Hina, Bambu,” “Wenga ungumanya vila ningukupala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu akamlongela, “Unileleli wanakondolu ghangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Akamkonya kangi liyanja lya ipili, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana ungunipala?” Simoni akayanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">“Hina Bambu,” “Wenga ungumanya vila ningukupala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu akamlongela kangi, “Unileleli kondolu ghangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Hinu Yesu akamkonya liyanja lya itatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana, ghuli, ungunipala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Petelo akakolwa na holu kwa vila amlongile miyanja itatu, “Ghuli ungunipala?” akalongela, “Bambu, wenga ungumanya hyogha, wenga ungumanya vila ningukupala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu akamlongela, “Unileleli kondolu ghangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Uchakaka ningukulongela, pauwelili mhongolu usyovelili kuliwopa mhunga na kuyenda kokosi kuupalili. Ila pautewela mgogolu utegholosa mawoku ghako, na mundu ghangi atekuwopa na kukuyegha kula wenga ungukupala ng'ogha. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu alongili nagha ili kulangiha vila Petelo atehova, na kihu kyaki vila kitemtundamilisa Sapanga. Hinu akamlongela, “Unikovekeli.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mvulwa mghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petelo akaghalambuka kuhyetu akamlola mvulwa mweni kupalwa nesu na Yesu, anguwakovekela, mvulwa hayu ndiwa yula atamili pabehi na Yesu lipindi wangulyegha mulyo na ndiwa amkonyili, “Bambu ni ghani atekuhyuka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Hinu petelo pamuwonili hayu, akamkonya Yesu, “Bambu, na hayu ghuli?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akamyanga,“Ikiva ningupala ahighali mkomu mpaka pala nihika, wenga ingukughasa niki? Wenga ungovikeli nenga.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Hinu habali hila ikalandala paghati gha walongu wala wamkwinila Yesu yiwa yula mvulwa atehova ng'ogha. Ila Yesu ailongile ng'ogha ghala ila ailongile yiwa, “Ikiwela ningupala ahighali mkomu mbaka pala nihika, hali lingukughasa niki?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Hayu ndiwa yula mvulwa amlongililile Yesu, na kuyandika milando hai. Na twenga tungumanya yiwa ayalongilile ni chakaka.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kuwela na mighalu mitangala Yesu aigholile na handa hyogha yangaliyandikwa mlima wogha ungalikwila ng'ogha kuvika vihitabu vingaliyandikwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>